<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Amaluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jammbone jijijaandikwe na Amaluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amaluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Amal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jammbone handa chijijaandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Amaluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani Jammbone jijijaandikwe na Amaluko, nga chimo mu hitabu ncheche hiibhile mu Lilagano Liyono yakubhehe hiikongolela umomi gwa Ayesu Kilisto. Kila chitabu chimo chabhe chikemwa Injili maana gakwe nga, “Ngani Jammbone.” Hitabu yeneyo hikajandikwa na angota Amatayo na Amaluko na Aluka na Ayohana baada ja Ayesu kujomoka. Injili jijikajaandikwa na Amaluko nga Injili jijipijipi muno kupeta yoha. Hela hela hitenda kuhobhaleka kubhee chitabu heche chitekujemeka kujandikwa tangu Injili yengi yangajandikwa pakati ja chaaka cha 1965 mpaka kuhikila 1970 baada ja kubhelekwa Ayesu Kilisito. Akaachomi bhajingi bhahobhalelenga kubhee chikajandika bhakibha ku Loma ligongo lya kwalekelanga mitima Akaakilichito bhajingi bhabhakibhanga ku Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Amaluko hela hela bhatenda kumanyikana handa Ayohana Amaluko bhakibha aganja bhabhe angota na akandundame Apaulo na Abalinaba nambo bhakakana kulongana nabho mu ulendo gwa kwaatangachianga bhandu Ngani Jammbone, hikobho 13:13, baada ja penapo Amaluko bhakabhoka ulendo kabhele na Abalinaba, hikubho 15:37-39, Amaluko bhakamanyikana handa aganja bhakubhandikila bha Apetulo, 1 Apetulo 5:13, hikibha hopo Amaluko bhangabhona umomi gwa Ayesu kwa miho gabhe, akaachomi bhajingi bhahobhalelanga kubhee Amaluko bhabhekite kombokelo hijingi gabhakakongolelwa na Apetulo na nga kujemeka kwa Injili jijijaandikwe na Amaluko. Mu Injili Amaluko bhatekulumikia bhandu bhabhee bhanapunji bha Ayesu na majigano ga Ayesu mu muda gwa kujomolekea.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile</para>
  <para style="io">Amaluko bhachitenda kuchikongolela chitabu cha kujemeka 1:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Amaluko bhakangolela ulendo gwa Ayessu kujaula ku Yelusalemu 1:14-21.</para>
  <para style="io">Amaluko bhalongela nnani ja ulendo gwa Ayesu kujaula ku Yelusalemu 8:22-10:52.</para>
  <para style="io">Amaluko bhatenda kujomolekea kwa kujandika nnani ja Ayesu pabhakibha ku Yelusalemu pamo na kujomoka kwabhe na kuyoka kwabhe 11:1-16:8.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Ayohana ammatichaji atangacha kuhika kwa Ayesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Amatayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Aluka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ayohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Kongo nga kujemeka kwa Ngani Jammbone jijaalenga Ayesu Kilisito, Amwana bha Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Jikajemeka handa chijikajandikwa mu chitabu cha alondohi bha Annoongo Aisaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Annongo bhakalobhola, ‘Naantuma anyumbe bhangu bhannongolele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">bhenabho apakunhalakia ndela jinu.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Amundu bhatendakema kubhoka palulemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Munhalakiange Hangwana ndela jabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">nchiandaange kwaapokela Hangwana pabhapakuhika!’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Henela anyumbe jonojwe akibha Ayohana Mmatichaji, bhakahika palulemba na kwaatangachianga bhandu na kwaabatichanga na abhikwalobholelanga bhandu bhalekange mabhou gabhenji ili Annoongo alekeleange mabhou gabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bhandu bhajingi kubhoka chilambo cha ku Yudea na chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu bhakibhanga bhatendakwaajendelela na kwaajonikia Ayohana, bhakakoondanga mabhou gabhenji na kuilekanga, na bhena akaabatichanga mu loochi lwa ku Yolodani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Ayohana akibha awalile chiwalo chichikatotwa kwa manjoja ga chinyama chichikemwa ngamia, na ng'oji gwa limbendela muchibhuno chabhe. Chakulya chabhe chakibha inune na bhuchi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Nabhena bhakatangacha bhabhikulobhola, “Pambakubhoka nenga bhapakuhika bhabhabhii na machili muno kupunda nenga, yakubhehe nenga ngapaalikwa hata kotima na kujogola migoji ya champali yabhe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nenga ndendakummatichanga kwa machi, nambo bhenabho bhapakummatichanga kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakubatichwa na kujigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Amatayo 3:13-4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Aluka 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Machobha genago, Ayesu akahika mu chilambo ku Nazaleti, ja ku Galilaya, na akahika kwa Ayohana na akaabaticha mu loochi lwa ku Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Popopo Ayesu pabhakachobhoka mmachi, akakubhona kunani kwa Annoongo kujogwike, na Mboomo ja Annoongo akaatulukia handa chibhatuluka nguunda, <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />na lilobhe lya Annoongo likajohanika kubhoka kunani kwa Annoongo libhikulobhola, “Mwenga nga Amwana bhangu junampala, ndekubhajilwa na mwenga.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Popopo Ayesu akalongolelwa na Mboomo ja Annoongo kujaula palulemba, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Ayesu bhakatama konokwe machobha makomi ncheche abhikujigwa na Lichetani. Akibha konokwe pamo na hinyama ya mmanyahi, na bhenaangota akaapangana mahengo bha kunani kulihunde bha Annoongo bhatendita kwahudumia.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwakemanga akaakoka ncheche bhankagule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Amatayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Aluka 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Machobha gajingi gakapeta Ayohana bhakatabhwa kumagelecha. Ayesu akajaula mu chilambo cha ku Galilaya, bhabhikutangacha Ngaani Jammbone ja Annoongo, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />bhakalobhola, “Machobha gabhandikile, machobha ga Annoongo kuhukumula. Nnekange mabhou ginunji na kuhobhalela Ngani Jammbone!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Lichobha limo Ayesu pabhakibha bhatendakupeta ngulugulu mwa litamanda lya ku Galilaya, akaabhona akaakoka homba bhabhele, Asimoni na anung'una bhabhe bhakemitwa Aandulea bhabhikoka homba kwa lipelele. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Ngagulange na nenga mbakunnyigananga kwaletanga bhandu kwaachangu handa chinkokanga homba.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Popopo bhakailekanga hipelele yabhenji, bhakaakagula. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Pabhakajaula nnongi kachoko, akaabhonanga Ayakobo na Ayohana, bhenaangota bhakibhanga bhana bha Azebedayo. Na bhenaangota kabhele bhakibhanga nkati ja ntumbwi gwabhenji bhabhikuhalakianga hipelele yabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Popopo Ayesu akaakemanga, na bhenaangota bhakaaleka atati bhabhe Azebedayo mu ntumbwi pamo na akaapangana mahengo, bhakaakagula Ayesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwalamia mundu jwaabhile na mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Aluka 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ngapena Ayesu pamo na bhenibhala bhabhachijigana bhabhe bhakajaulanga mu chilambo cha ku Kapelenaumu na palikahika Lichobha lya Kupomolela kwa Bhayahudi, Ayesu akajingila mu Nyuumba ja kongalilana Bhayahudi, akajemeka kujigana. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Bhandu bhoha bhabhakannyonikia Ayesu bhakakangacha kwa majigano gakwe, kwakubhee ajigana handa bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa ila ajigana handa mundu jwaabhile na ukolo.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Popopo nkati ja Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi pakibha na mundu jumo jwaakapoganikwa na mahoka, akapalia lilobhe bhabhilukolobhola, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Mmii na niki na twenga, mwenga Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti? Bholi, ntekuhika kututinia? Niimanyi mwenga nga ganiki, mwenga nga junnetitwe kubhoka kwa Annoongo!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Ayesu bhakalikalipila lyenilyela lihoka, akaalobholela, “Nkotoke! Mmoke kwa habha amundu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Lyenilyela lihoka likaapukunya kwa machili amundu bhenabho, ngapena bhakaguta kwa lilobhe likolongwa, bhakaabhoka. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bhandu bhoha bhakakangachanga, bhakakonyananga, “Nga hikubho niki yenjeni? Bholi, nga majigano gayono kabhele, gagabhii na mamulaka Amundu habha kuhukumula hata mahoka na bhenaangota bhatendakwaakonda!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Henela ngani ya Ayesu hikajenela chindema koha mu chilambo cha ku Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwalamia bhandu bhajingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Amatayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Aluka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe pabhakabhokanga mu Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi, Asimoni na Aandulea na Ayohana na Ayakobo bhakajaulanga mpaka kaja kwa Asimoni na Aandulea. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Bahi, haikege bhamo, haki bhabhe Asimoni, bhakibha pachindanda bhatendakulwala chitamwa, na bhenaangota bhakannobholela Ayesu ngani yabhe. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Ayesu akaajendela jono mwikege, akaakamula lubhoko, akannyimua. Na chenichela chitamwa akalama, akajemeka kwaatumikilanga.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Pajikahika kimuho na Lichobha lya Kupomolela palikajomoka, bhakaaletela Ayesu akaatamwa bhoha na bhabhakibhanga na mahoka. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bhandu bhoha bha chenichela chilambo bhakakondekananga panja ja nlyango. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Nabhena Ayesu akaalamiyanga bhandu bhajingi bhabhakibhanga na hitamwa yengi yengi, akagabhenga mahoka gajingi, nambo angaalekelelanga gena mahoka kulongela chilebhe ligongo bhatendita kumanyanga bhena nga aganiki.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatangacha Ngani Jammbone chilambo cha ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Aluka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Malabhi jakwe, pangali tangu kuchee, Ayesu akabhoka, akajaula pantemela kwaajopa Annoongo, <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Asimoni na akaajabhe bhajaulanga kwaalolela, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />pabhakammona bhakannobholela, “Bhandu bhoha bhatendakunnolea mwenga.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Tujaulange mu hijiji yengi hiibhandikile ngatangache konokwe Ngani Jammbone kabhele, maana ndekuhika kwa lihengo lyenelyo. <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ayesu bhakajaula mu chilambo choha cha ku Galilaya bhabhikutangachanga mu Nyuumba ya konganilana Bhayahudi na kugabhenga mahoka.”<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamiya amundu bha mambujupuju</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Amatayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Aluka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Amundu bhamo bhabhabhile na mambujupuju bhakaajendela Ayesu, bhakaatindibhalila majugwa, bhakaajopa, “Handa mpalite, mpakombola kunyelejea!” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Ayesu akaakole kiha, bhakanyulula lubhoko lwabhe, bhakaakwaa na kwaalobholela, “Ndendakupala! Nnyelejeike!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Popopo amundu bhenabho akalama mambujupuju gabhe, bhakajelejeka. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Popopo Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhajaule na kwaanyamuka, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Nkotokunnobholela amundu bhoahabhala ngani jenjeni, ila nnyabhule nkachilangie kwa akung'i na nkabhoe mbeeko ligongo lya kujelejeka kwinu handa chibhakalagia Amusa ili kwaalangianga bhandu kubhehe nnamite.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Nambo bhena amundu bhakajaula, bhakajemeka kujenea ngani jenejo koha na Ayesu bhangakombola kujiingila mu hilambo yabhenji kwa kubhonekana, hikapaalikwa bhatame panja mahali pantemela. Hata henela, bhandu bhakaajendela kubhoka ku kila upande.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwalamia mundu jwaapolite mmele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Amatayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Aluka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Pabhakajomola machobha genago, Ayesu akabhuja mu chilambo cha ku Kapelenaumu, bhandu bhakapatanga ngani kubhehe abhujite kubhatama. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Bahi, bhakahikanga bhandu bhajingi muno, kubhehe pangaigala hata pachoko bhakatwelelanga mpaka panlyango. Kongo Ayesu abhikwaatangachianga lilobhe lya Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ngapena bhandu teno bhakahikanga na kwaaletela Ayesu amundu jwaapolite mmele, abhi atekupetulikwa na bhandu ncheche. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Henela, bhangakombolanga kwaapeleka kubhandikila na Ayesu ligongo lya nkutuli gwa bhandu bhajingi. Bhakakwelanga nnani ja chipagala bhakapobholananga mahali pabhakibha Ayesu. Pabhakapatanga upenyo, bhakantulua jono mundu abhi agolikwe pachindanda. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ayesu pabhakabhona bhatenda kunhobhalela, akaalobholela bhena amundu jwaapolite mmele, “Aganja bhangu ndekunlekelela mabhou ginu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bhabhajigananga Malagilo ga Amusa bhangi. Bhabhakibhanga bhatamitinge penapo bhakaganikianga mu mitima yabhenji, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Bhakombola bholi kulongela henela? Habhabha atendakwaaponja Annoongo! Nga ganiki jwaakombola kulekelea ubhou ila nga Annoongo jika jabhe?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Popopo Ayesu akamanya kuganikila kwabhenji, akaakonyanga, “Mboni ng'anikianga henela mu mitima yinunji? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Nga chikubho niki chichibhile cha kupepeka muno, kwaalobholela habha amundu bhabhapolite mmele, ‘Ntekulekelelwa gabhou ginu,’ au kwaalobholela, ‘Nyimuke! Mpetule chindanda chinu nnyabhule?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Bahi, mbala muimanye kubhehe Mwana jwa amundu atekola mamulaka ga kwaalekelea bhandu mabhou gabhenji pachilambo.” Ngapena Ayesu akannobholela amundu bhenibhala bhabhapolite mmele, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Ndendakunnobholela nnyeme, ntole chindanda chinu nnyabhule kaja!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Popopo mundu jonojwe jwaapolite mmele akajema, na akatola chindanda chabhe, akajenda nnongi ja bhandu bhoa. Bhandu bhoa bhakakangachanga na kwaalumbalila Annoongo na kulongela, “Twangabhona hopo chilebhe handa chenjeni.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwakema Alawi ankagule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Amatayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Aluka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Ayesu akajaula kabhele nngulugulu ja litanda lwa ku Galilaya. Bhandu bhajingi bhakaajendela, nabhena bhakajemeka kwaajigananga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Pabhatendita kupeta, bhakaabhona Alawi amwana bha Aalufayo, bhataamite panyumba ja kutochea kodi. Ayesu akannolobholela, “Nngagule!” Alawi bhakajema, na kwaakagula Ayesu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ngapena Ayesu pabhakibha pakaja pa Alawi, kulyee ndalilo, pamo na akaatocha kodi bhajingi na bhabhatenditinge gabhou Akaatocha kodi bhajingi na bhabhatenditinge gabhou na bhanapunji bhabhe ligongo pakibha na bhandu bhajingi bhabhakankagula. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Bhabhajigana Maligalilo ga Amusa bhangi bhabhakibhanga Mafalisayo pabhakammona Ayesu bhabhikulyee pamo na bhandu bhabhatenditinge gabhou na akaatocha kodi, bhakaakonyanga bhenibhala bhanapunji bhabhe, “Kwa niki Ayesu bhatendakulyee pamo na akaatocha kodi na bhabhatendanga gabhou?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Ayesu pabhakajoa genago, akaajangulanga, “Bhandu bhangalwalanga ngaakema hopo aganga, bhabhampala nga bhenibhala bhabhalwalanga. Nangaika kwaakemanga bhandu bhammbone, ila bhenibhala bhabhatenditinge gabhou.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakulengania majigano gayono na majigano ga lolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Amatayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Aluka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Wakati gumo bhanapunji bha Ayohana na bhanapunji bha Mafalisayo bhatendita kutabha. Bahi bhandu bhakahikanga, bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Kwa niki bhanapunji bha Ayohana na Mafalisayo bhatendakutabhanga, nambo bhanapunji bhinu mwenga ngatabhanga?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Ayesu akaajangula, “Bholi, bhabhaalalike kuulombela bhapaalikwa kutabhanga wakati hangwana ulombela bhabhii pamo na bhenaangota? Wakati goha pabhakibha pamo na hangwana ulombela ngakombolanga kutabha. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Nambo wakati gupakuhika yakubhehe hangwana ulombela apakubhoka pakati jabhenji, nga pena bhapakutabhanga.”<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Bhandu ngaheketanga chibhamba cha ngobho jiyono na kutotela mu ngobho ja lolo. Handa bhatenditinge henela, chenecho chibhamba chiyono chipakujonjokea lipobhole mu jenejo ngobho ja lolo, na jenejo ngobho jipakuhalibika muno. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Wala bhandu ngalekelanga divai jiyono mu mihuko ja lolo jijitotitwe na limbendela. Handa bhatenditinge henela, divai hejo hipakuipapulana yeneyo mihuko ja limbendela, na jenejo divai jipakujitika na mihuko ja limbendela jipakupapuka. Divai jiyono jilekelwa mu mihuko ja mambendela!”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atenditakujenda mu Lichobha lya Kupomolela Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Amatayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Aluka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Lichobha limo lya Kupomolela Bhayahudi, Ayesu atendita kujenda mu migonda ja chakulya handa mapemba. Pabhakibha bhatendakujenda, bhanapunji bhabhe Ayesu bhakajemekanga kukeleta maache handa ga mapemba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafalisayo bhakannobholela, “Nnyonikie! Kwa niki bhatendanga chikubho changapaalikwa kutenda Lichobha lya Kupomolela?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Bholi, mwangachomanga mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo chibhakatenda Adaudi wakati bhena na akaajabhe pabhakibhanga na njala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Adaudi akajiingila nkati ja Nyuumba ja Annoongo, akalyee mikate hiibhekitwe nnongi ja Annoongo. Chikubho chenjeni chikatendekwa na Aabiatali pabhakibha akung'i akolongwa. Na nga akaakung'i jika jabhenji nga bhabhapalikwanga kulyee mikate jenejo, nambo Adaudi akalyee, kabhele akaapekeanga na akaajabhe.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Bahi, Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Lichobha lya Kupomolela likabhekwa ligongo lya kwaajangatila bhandu na ngabha bhandu kubhee akaabhanda bha Lichobha lya Kupomolela! <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kabhele, nenga Mwana jwa Aadamu nga Hangwana bha Lichobha lya Kupomolela.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu annamia mundu mu Lichobha lya Kupomolela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Amatayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Aluka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Lichobha lyengi lya Kupomolela Ayesu bhakajingila kabhele Mu nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi na monimola nkati mwakibha na mundu jwaapolite lubhoko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mu nyuumba jenejo, Mafalisayo teno bhatendita kulendela bhaalamie amundu bhenabho Lichobha lya Kupomolela ili bhapatange kwaachitaki. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Ayesu akaalobholela bhena amundu bhabhapolite lubhoko, “Nnyeme nhike pambani pakati.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Penapo, bhakaakonyanga, “Bholi, hipaalikwa Lichobha lya Kupomolela kutenda chikubho chammbone au kutenda chikubho changalimmbone, kukoomboa umomi au kugukoma?” Nambo bhenaangota bhangalongelanga lilobhe. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Penapo Ayesu akaalolanga bhoa kwa lilaka, bhakabhona kiha mu ntima gwabhe ligongo lya kulepela kuhobhalela kwabhenji. Kabhele akaalobholela bhenibhala amundu, “Nnyulule lubhoko lwinu!” Nabhena akalunyulula lubhoko lwabhe, gukabhehe nkoto. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Popopo Mafalisayo bhakabhokanga panja, bhakalongelanga pamo na bhandu bha chibhoga cha bhandu chichajaangatila Ahelode namuna ja kwaakoma Ayesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkutuli gwa bhandu gwaakagula Ayesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Ayesu akabhoka penapo pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe, bhakajaula kubhandikila na litanda lya ku Galilaya, na lilubhalo lya bhandu bhajingi likaakagula. Bhandu habho bhabhokita ku Galilaya na ku Yudea. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Bhandu pabhakajoa genago gabhatendite bhandu bhajingi bhakaakagula Ayesu, kubhoka ku Yelusalemu na kubhoka ku Idumea, kuuwelo ja loochi lwa Yolodani, pamo na bhenibhala bhabhabhandikile hilambo ya ku Tilo na ku Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela bhanapunji bhabhe bhaabhekele ntumbwi gumo ili nkondekano gwa bhandu gukoto kwaaminya minya ligongo lya bhandu bhajingi. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kwa kubehe akaalamiha akaatamwa bhajingi bhenibhala akaatamwa bhatendita kunokolana ili bhakombolange kunkwaa. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na bhandu bhabhakibhanga na mahoka pabhakammona, bhakajigwianga pahi nnongi jabhe na kupalia lilobhe, bhakalobhola, “Mwenga nga Amwana bha Annoongo!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Nambo Ayesu akaakulumikiha kwa kalipa bhakoto kulobhola bhenabho nga aganiki.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwaagula akaandundame komi na bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Amatayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Aluka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ayesu bhakakwela pachitombi, akaakemanga bhenibhala bhabhakaapala. Bahi, bhakaajendela, <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />nabhena bhakaahagulanga bhandu komi na bhabhele yakubhehe bhaakakemanga akaandundame bhakaalobholelanga ili bhatamange nabho, na bhaatumange kujaula kutangacha, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na bhabhee na mamulaka ga kwaabhenganga mahoka. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Bhandu bhabhaagwile nga habhabha, Asimoni yakubhehe Ayesu bhakaapekea lina, Apetulo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Ayakobo na Ayohana, bhaana bha Azebedayo nambo Ayesu akabhakemanga Aboanelige, maana gakwe, “Bhana bha Nlindimilo” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Aandulea na Afilipo na Abatolomayo na Amatayo na Atomaso na Ayakobo amwana bha Aalufayo na Atadei na Asimoni bhabhapotanila chilambo chabhe, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Ayuda Aisikalioti yakubhee baadaye bhakaagaluka Ayesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nga akolo kupunda Abelizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Amatayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Aluka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Ngapena Ayesu akabhuja kaja na nkutuli gwa bhandu gukakondekana kabhele, hata Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe bhangakombolanga kulyee chakulya ligongo bhatendita kwaahudumianga bhandu. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Akaalongo bhabhe pabhakapatanga ngani jenejo bhakajaula ili bhaapetule ligongo bhandu bhatendakulongelanga kubhehe, “Atamwa mpangai.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Na bhabhajigana bha Malagilo ga Amusa bhabhakatulukanga kubhoka ku Yelusalemu, bhakalobholanga, “Bhatekamulikwa na Abelizebuli akolo bha mahoka, nga maana bhatenda kwaabhenganga mahoka kwa machili ga akolo bha mahoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Penapo Ayesu bhakaakemanga, bhakaalobholelanga kwa kulandanakia, “Bholi, hikomboleka bholi, Lichetani kuchibhenga mweene? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Handa chilambo chimetunike mu mabhoga mabhoga, chilambo chenecho ngakomboleka kujema. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Kabhele, ikabhehe bhandu bha nyuumba jimo handa bhametunike malubhalo malubhalo, nyuumba jenejo jikombola hopo kujema. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Na handa ikabhehe lichetani atenda kuchikana mweene na handa atekumetunika ngakombola kujema na kujomoka kwabhe kutekubhandikila.”<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Bhakwa amundu bhabhakombola kujingila mu nyuumba ja amundu bhabhakweti machili na kwaapokonyola hilebhe yabhe pangali kwaatabha. Handa bhaatabhite nga bhapakombola kwaapokonyola hilebhe yabhe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, bhandu bhapakulekelelwa gabhou gabhenji goha na kwaaponja kwabhenji koha, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />nambo bhabhapakulongela mabhou kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo, bhalekelelwa hopo machobha goha, bhapakubhehe na mabhou machobha goha.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Ayesu bhakalongela henela kwa ligongo bhatenditanga kulongelanga, “Bhatekamulikwa na mahoka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyongolo na akaanung'una bha kweli bha Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Amatayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Aluka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Anyongo bhabhe Ayesu na akaanung'una bha Ayesu bha kweli bhakahikanga penapo, bhakajemanga panja, bhakaatuma amundu bhaakeme Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Bhandu bhajingi bhakibha bhatamitinge kwa kwaatimbilila Ayesu, nabhena bhakaalobholela, “Anyongo bhinu na akaanung'una bhinu bhabhilinge panja, bhapalanga kummona.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Anyongo bhangu na akaanung'una bhangu nga achiganiki?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ngapena bhakaalolanga bhenibhala bhandu bhabhatamitinge kwa kwaatimbilila kila upande, bhakalobhola, “Nnyoonikie! Habhabha bhabhanyoanikianga nga akaanyongo bhangu na akaanung'una bhangu bha kweli! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Amundu bhoabhala bhabhatenda gabhapala Annoongo, bhenabho nga apwanga bhangu, na alombo bhangu, na anyongo bhangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia na bhabhamicha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Amatayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Aluka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Ayesu bhakajemeka kujigana kabhele bhakibha kubhandikila na litanda lya ku Galilaya. Lilubhalo likolongwa lya bhandu bhajingi likaatimbilila na hikaapalikwa bhajingile mu ntumbwi gugukibha mu litanda na kutama monomwe. Na bhena bhandu bhoha bhakibha bhatamitinge nngulugulu ja litanda pachilambo chijomo panga machi. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Akaajigananga hilebhe hijingi kwa kulandanakia, na mu majigano gabhe akaalobholelanga,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Nyoonikiange! Alemi bhamo akajaula kumicha mbeju. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Pabhatendita kumicha mbeju, yengi hikagwee nngulugulu mwa ndela, hijuni hikaika na kulyee. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Yengi hikagwee pamwala pangali na undopi nniyngi, hikamela chindema kwa kubhehe undopi gukibha kachoko. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Lyobha palikapitila, hikanyalila, na kwa kubhehe mikega yabhe ikibha yangatibhila pahi muno, hikajoma. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbeju yengi hikagwila mu miibha, na yene miibha hikakola na kuhiminya minya henela yangahogola mbeju joajela. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Yengi hikagwila mu undopi gwammbone, hikamela maha na kukola na kuogola, gumo gukaogola makomi gatatu, gongi makomi sita na gongi makomi komi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Bhabhabhii na machikilo gakujohanikia na bhajoanikie!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ligongo lya Ayesu kujigana kwa kulandanakia</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Amatayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Aluka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Nambo Ayesu pabhakibha jikajabhe, pakati ja bhenibhala bhabhannyoa bhakaajendelela pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe komi na bhabhele bhakahika kwaakonya maana ja kulandanikia konikola. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Na Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Mwangota ntekupatanga kuimanyanga chili ya ukolo gwa Annoongo, nambo bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge panja bhapakulobholelwanga kila chilebhe kwa kulandanakia, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Bhalolange kweli, nambo bhakotokubhonanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Bhajoange kweli, nambo bhakotokuhimanyanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Handa bhaimanyitinge, bhapakwaabhujila Annoongo ili bhaalekelelanga.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu atenda kuatambula kulandanikia na bhabhamicha mbeju</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Amatayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Aluka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ngapena, Ayesu akaakonyanga, “Bholi, mwangota ngamanya maana ja kulandanakia kongoni? Nangocheni mpakombola bholi kumanyanga kulandanikia kongi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Bhabhamicha kumicha lilobhe lya Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bhandu bhangi nga handa mbeju hiikagwila nngulugulu ja ndela bhalandala na bhandu bhabhajoine lilobhe lya Annoongo nambo baada ja kulijoa Lichetani kuhika na kulitola lilobhe lilipandintwe nkati jabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Mbeju hiigwila pa undopi nchokochoko nga handa bhandu bhabhajoa lilobhe na kulipokela kwa kuhangalala. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Nambo bhabhahobhalela lilobhe kwa muda n'jipijipi ligongo bhabhilinge handa mimea yanga mikega. Pabhalaganga na kuangaika ligongo lya lilobhe lya Annoongo penapo kuengeleka mitima. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Mbeju hiikagwela pamiibha hilandana na bhandu bhabhajoanga lilobhe, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />nambo kuhabhukila umomi gwa pachilambo na kupala hilebhe na kulokolila hilebhe yengi kuhika na kuliminya minya lilobhe na bhalitendelahopo lihengo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Bhangi nga handa yeniyela mbeju hiipanditwe mu undopi gwammbone. Pabhakajoanga lilobhe lya Annoongo bhalijoanga na kulitendela lihengo, yengi hikaogola makomi tatu, yengi hikaogola makomi sita na yengi hikaogola makomi komi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandana na lumuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Aluka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Ayesu bhakapunda kwalobholelanga, “Bholi, bhandu kujakia lumuli na kujiwekela na chijaluba au kujibheka kuhi ja chindanda? Bholi, ngajaakia na kujibheka pachitombenga? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Hela hela, choachela chibhachiite chipakubhonekana, na chilebhe choachela chichitekuwekelwa chipakuhunukulilwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Bhabhakweti na machikilo gakujioanikia na bhajoanikie!” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Ayesu bhakapunda kulongela, “Nnyoonikiange muno hela hela chichibhoite kujoanikia lilobhe! Henela nga Annoongo chiapakututenda kuimanye kabhele Annoongo bhapakuntenda lilobhe mulimanye muno. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Bhenibhala amundu bhabhajoanikia lilobhe lya Annoongo na kulimanya, Annoongo bhapakwajangatila na kwaatenda bhalimanye muno. Handa amundu ngajoanikia lilobhe lya Annoongo hata lilobhe lichoko lya Annoongo libhaliamanya bhapakwapokonyola.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia na mbeju jijimela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Ayesu bhakapunda kulongela, “Ukolo gwa Annoongo gubhi handa henela. Mundu jumo bhakamicha mbeju kumigonda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Kilo bhatenda kugoloka na muhi bhabhee miho na wakati gonogwe mbeju hitendakumela na kukola, pangali bhenabho kuhimanya chiitenda namuna hitenda kukola. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Hikabhee henela ligongo undopi gwene kujangatila mbeju kumela na kukola na kuogola mabibu, kujemeka kuhipuka oti lihamba, ngapena liache, na ngapena kubhoa njelegwa jijibhii muliache. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Puunje pajikomala, bhena amundu kujingila kumigonda na chikwakwa jakuhunila kwa kubhee muda gwa kuhuna guhikite.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulandanikia na mbeju ja haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Amatayo 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Aluka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Tugulandanakie Ukolo gwa Annoongo na chiniki? Tugukongolele kwa kulandanikia na chiniki? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ukolo gwa Annoongo nga handa mbeju ja haladali yakubhee nga jichoko kupunda mbeju yoha hiibhi pachilambo. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Nambo anajipanditwe, kumela na kubhehe nkongo nkolongwa kupunda mikongo yoha ya mumigonda. Nyaambi yabhe kubhehe ngolongwa hata hijuni hikombola kuchenga yua yabhenji mu nheka gwa nyaambi yakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Kwa kulandanikia kongi kujingi Ayesu bhakalongela nabho kwa lilobhe lyabhe. Kwa namuna chibhakakombola kumanyanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ayesu bhangalongela nabho chohachela panga kulandanakia, nambo pabhakibha pamo na bhanapunji bhena bhatendita kwaalobholelanga na kwaatambulilanga kila chilebhe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhachihukumula chimboonga chikotoke mulitanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Amatayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Aluka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Lichobha helyo pajikabhandikila kimuo, Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Tujoomboke kuntundu ja litanda.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bahi, bhakalileke lyene lilubhalo lya bhandu bhajingi, bhanapunji bhakajingilia muntumbwi mwabhakibha Ayesu bhakajaula pamo nabho. Na mitumbwi yengi hikalongana nabho kongo hibhii na bhandu. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Pakabhokela na chimboonga chikolongwa, mawimbi ga machi gakapota gonigola ntumbwi pamwakibha Ayesu na penapo gonigo ntumbwi kugajemeka kutwelela machi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Ayesu bhakibha kuyetu ja ntumbwi, bhagolwike nnaji ja nhegamo. Bahi, bhanapunji bhenabho bhakannyimua na kwaalobholela, “Bholi, bhannyigana, mmonahopo handa twenga tutendakutibhila?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Ayesu bhakajimuka, bhakachikopokea chenichee chimboonga, bhakagahukumula genigala mawimbi, “Mme jii! Nkotoke!” Cheni chela chimboonga chikakotoka, na chikabhee jii. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaakonyanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Kwaniki ntenda kujogopanga? Bholi, tangu mwangaobhalelanga?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Na bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajogopa muno, bhakibha bhatendakonyananga, “Habha nga aganiki bahi, hata chimboonga na mawimbi gatendakunyoonikia?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamiya amundu bhabhahii na mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Amatayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Aluka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe, bhakahikanga kuntundu ja litanda lya ku Galilaya mu chilambo cha Bhagelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ayesu pabhakatuluka kubhoka mu ntumbwi, amundu bhamo bhabhakachukilwa na lihoka bhakabhoka kumakabuli, bhakakongana nabho. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Amundu bhenabho bhatendita kutama kumakabuli na wala bhaakwa amundu bhangi bhoabhala bhabhakakombola kwaatabha kwa minyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Kwakubhee mala ijingi bhakaatabha kwa ngamulo na minyololo mmabhoko na mmakongono, nambo bhakakombola kuheketa gena minyololo na kuikajula yene ngamulo, na bhakwa amundu bhabhakakombola kwahibhila. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Kilo na muhi bhakatama kumakabuli na kumatombi bhabhikupalia lilobhe na kuchiheketaheketa kwa maganga.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Pabhakammona Ayesu kwa kutali, bhakaabhutukila na kutindibhala majugwa nnoongi jabhe. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Bhakalongela kwa lilobhe likolongwa, “Mmpala niki kubhoka kwaachangu, mwenga Ayesu Amwana bha Annoonngo bhabhabhile kunani muno? Kwa lina lya Annoongo, ndendakunyoopa nkotokunagia!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Bhakalongela henela kwa kubhehe Ayesu bhatekunnobholela, “Lihoka, mmoke kwa habha amundu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Bahi, Ayesu bhaakonya, “Lina linu aganiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Nabhena bhakajangula, “Lina lyangu nga linyemba, maana twenga tubhii bhajingi!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Penapo genigala mahoka gakaajopa Ayesu akoto kugabhenganga kubhoka panja ja chenichee chilambo.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Pakibhakibhanga penapo pakibha na lilubhalo likolongwa lya magolobhe bhabhikulyenganga pachielelo cha litombi. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Bahi, gena mahoka gakaapembelela Ayesu, “Ntupeleke kwa genigala magolobhe, ntulekelange tukaajingilange.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Bahi Ayesu bhakaalekeleanga. Bahi gena mahoka gakabhokanga, gakaajingilanga genigaila magolobhe. Lilubhalo lyoha lya magolobhe likagwee pa chenichela chielelo chikolongwa mpaka mulitanda, na kutibhila mmachi gakawee na bhabhakibhanga handa elupu jibhele.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Bhabhalianga genigaa magolobhe bhakabhutukanga, bhakatangachanga ngani jenejo kunnyini na muijiji. Bhandu bhakahikanga kubhona hiikapitila. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Bhakahikanga kwa Ayesu, bhakammona na amundu bhala bhala bhabhakachukilwa na mahoka bhatemite pahi, bhawalite ngobho kongo bhatondwibhe, bhakajogopanga. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bhandu bhapakabhololanga ngani hejo bhakaakongolelanga bhangi hikubho hiikaapata bhena amundu bhabhakachukilwa na mahoka na genigaa magolobhe. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ngapena, bhakajemekanga kwaapembelea Ayesu bhabhoke mu chilambo chabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ayesu pabhakwelita mu ntumbwi, bhenibhala amundu bhabhakibha na mahoka bhakaajopa kulongana nabho. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaakanila. Nambo bhakaalobholela, “Nnyabhule kaaja kwa akaalongo bhinu, nkaalobholele hilebhe yoha Hangwana hibhakantendela na namuna chibhakankolelekea kiha.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Bahi, bhena amundu bhakajaula, bhakajemeka kutangacha konokwe ku chilambo cha ku Dekapoli maana gakwe hilambo komi, ngani yoha Ayesu hibhantendile, bhandu bhoa bhakakangachanga.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhakaayoa amwali bha Ayailo na kwalamia haikege bhamo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Amatayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Aluka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ayesu bhakajoomboka kabhele upaande gwa bhele gwa litanda lya ku Galilaya kwa ntumbwi. Pabhakibha nngulugulu ja litanda nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu gukakondekana kubhandikila na bhenabho. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Penapo bhakahika jumo jwa akaakolo bha Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi bhakemitwa Ayailo. Pabhakammona Ayesu, bhakatindibhala majugwa na kotima nnoongi ja makongono ga Ayesu, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />bhakaajopa bhabhikulongela, “Mwali jwangu nga ntamwa tweja tweja atendakubhandikila kuwee. Choonde tujende, nkaabhekela mabhoko ginu, bhapate kulama na kubhee bhamomi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakajaula pamo na bhenabho. Bhandu bhajingi muno bhakaakagula, bhakibhanga bhajingi bhakaatindila na kwaaminya minya. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Pakati jabhenji pakibha na haikege bhamo bhabhalwala chitamwa cha ncholocholo kwa yaaka komi na hibhele. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Haikege bhenabho bhakalaga muno na kwaajendela akaaganga bhajingi. Na bhakatumia mbiya yabhe yoha, nambo bhangapata mbaya na penapo hali jabhe jikapunda kubhee jangalimmbone. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Pabhakahijoa ngani ya Ayesu, na henela bhakachipekenya pa lilubhalo bhakaajendela Ayesu kwa kuyeto kwaakwaa ngobho jabhe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Bhakatenda henela, ligongo bhakachilobholela mwena muntima gwabhe, “Handa ngwaite ngobho jabhe tu, mbakulama.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Popopo miyahi jabhe jikakotoka kuolola, nabhena bhakachijohanikiha kubhehe mmele gwabhe jojolo gulamite. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Popopo Ayesu bhakang'ang'anuka kubhee machili gabhe ga kulamia gateendite lihengo. Bahi bhakatendebhukila lyenilyela lilubhalo lya bhandu bhajingi, bhakakonya, “Aganiki bhabhakwaite ngobho jangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakaajangula, “Ntendakubhona namuna bhandu chibhamminya minya, mpakumanya bholi bhabhankwaite?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Nambo Ayesu bhakapunda kulola koha koha ili bhaabhone bhabhaakwaaite. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Penapo bhena haikege, bhabhikuimanya gagatendikwe kwaachabhe, bhakabhoka kongo bhabhikulendemela kwa bhoga, bhakatindibhala majugwa na kotima nnongi ja Ayesu na kulongela ukweli goa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Aganja bhangu, kuhobhalela kwinu kutekunnamia. Nnyabhule kwa kuhengwa, kulaga kwinu kujoomwike.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Ayesu pabhakibha tangu bhatendakulongela, bhandu bhakahikanga kubhoka kaja kwa bhenibhala akolo bha Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi, bhakannobholela, “Mwali jwinu ajomwike. Kwa niki kwaabhua Bhabhajigana?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Nambo Ayesu bhangajohanikiha chibhalongilinge bhakaalobholela akolo bha Nyuumba ja konganilana, “Nkotokujogopa, nhobhalele tu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ayesu bhangapala kulongana na amundu bhoabhala ila nga Apetulo na Ayakobo na Ayohana anung'una bhabhe Ayakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bhakahikanga kaja kwa Ayailo na bhena Ayesu bhakajoa nyenye, nguto na minyembo ja kumalilo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Pabhakajingila nkati, akaalobholelanga, “Mboni mpotanga nyenye na kuguta? Mwali jwangajomoka, bhatekugoloka tu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Nambo bhenibhala bhandu bhakaaheka kwa kwaabhelua, bahi, akaabhoanga bhoa panja, na akaapetulanga atati bhabhe na anyongo bhabhe jono mwali na bhenibhala bhanapunji bhabhe bhenibhala bhabhakibha nabho, bhakajingilanga mu chumba chibhakang'oneka jono mwali. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ngapena bhakaakamula lubhoko, bhakaalobholela, “Talita, kumi,” maana gakwe, “Mwali, ndendakunnobholela nnyimuke!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Popopo amwali bhakajema, bhakajemeka kujenda. Amwali jonojwe bhakibha na yaaka komi na hibhele. Bhandu bhabhakibhanga bhabhakangachanga muno. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ayesu bhakaakanikia muno bhakotokunnobholela amundu bhoabhala chiibhokile, nabhena bhakaakulumikianga akaabhelei bhabhe bhaapekee jonijoo mwali chaakulya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Bhandu bha ku Nazaleti bhaakana Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Amatayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Aluka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Ayesu bhakabhoka penapo na bhakabhuja pa chilambo cha ku Nazaleti kubhakolile, bhabhi bhalongine na bhanapunji bhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Lichobha lya Kupomolela palikahika, bhakajemeka kujigana mu Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi. Bhandu bhajingi bhabhakanyonikia bhakakangachanga, bhakachikonyanga, “Bholi, habha amundu bhapatite koji majigano gangani? Bholi, nga malango ga namuna niki aga gabhapatite? Na kwa namuna niki bhatenda hikubho heye yakangachika? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Bholi, habha ngabha bhenibhala bhabhabhacha nkongo, amwana bha Amalia, na anung'una bhabhe angota Ayakobo na Ayose na Ayuda na Asimoni? Bholi, akaalombo bhabhe ngati bhatamanga pani pani kwaachitu?” Na bhenaangota hikaachimwanaga muno na bhakakananga kwaahobhalela.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Alondohi bhatendakutopewa kongi koha, ila mu chilambo chabhe ngaatopela kwa akaalongo bhabhe na akaanung'una bhabhe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Bhangatenda yakangachika penapo, ila bhakaabhekelanga mabhoko bhakaatamwa kachoko, na kwaalamihanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ayesu bhakakangacha muno ligongo bhanganhobhalela.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Ayesu bhatenda kwaatumanga bhanapunji komi na bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Amatayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Aluka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Ayesu bhakibha bhatendakuhityangila hijiji hiibhandikile penipala na kwaajigananga bhandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Bhakaakemanga bhenibhala bhanapunji komi na bhabhele, bhakaapekeanga mamulaka ga kwaabhenganga mahoka na bhakajemeka kwaatumanga bhabhele bhabhele, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />bhakabhakulumikianga, “Nkotokupetulanga choachela pannyaulanga ila mpetulange nkongojo. Nkotokupetulanga chaakulya, wala nkoba, wala mbiya. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Nhwalange champali nambo nkotokupetulanga ngobho yengi ya kutindigana.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Kabhele bhakaalobholelanga, “Handa bhampokilinge mu nyuumba johajela, ntamange monomwe mpaka pampakubhokanga mu chilambo chenecho. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mahali pohapala yakubhee bhandu bhapakananga kumpokelanga na kunnyoonikianga, mmokange penapo na kuchipyata lutukunda mmakongono ginunji kwakelebhua kubhee Annoongo bhatekwakananga.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Bahi, bhanapunji bhakabhokanga, bhakaatangachianga bhandu bhalekange mabhou gabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bhakibha kugabhenganga mahoka gajingi, bhakibha bhatendakwapakalanga mahuta akaatamwa bhajingi, bhakaalamiyanga.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujomoka kwa Ayohana Ambatichaji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Amatayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Aluka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Bahi, akolo Ahelode bhakagajoa genago goha, kwakubhee Ayesu bhakamanyikana muno. Bhandu bhajingi bhatendita kulongela, “Ayohana Ambatichaji bhayokite bhatenda yakangachika ligongo nga alondohi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Habha nga alondohi Aelia bhayokite.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Na bhangi bhakalobholanga, “Habhabha nga bhamo bha akaalondohi bhangi bhayokite.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Nambo Ahelode pabhakajoa ngani yenjeni bhakalobhola, “Habhabha nga Ayohana Ambatichaji, bhanakaaheketa mutwe bhayokite.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ahelode bhakalobhola henela ligongo, bhakalagakia kubhehe Ayohana Ambatichaji bhakamulikwe, bhatabhwe na kulekelwa mmagelecha. Bhakatenda henela kwa ligongo lya Ahelodia, hanu bha Afilipo anung'una bhabhe, yakubhee Ahelode bhabhakaalombela. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ahelode bhakaatendela Ayohana henela ligongo bhakibha bhaalobholile, “Ngapaalikwa kwaachinu kwaalombela hanu bha anung'una bhinu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Bahi, Ahelodia bhakaachimwa muno Ayohana, bhakibha bhapala kwaakoma, nambo bhangakoombola, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />ligongo Ahelode bhakibha bhatendakwaalolekea. Ahelode bhakibha bhatendakwaajogopa Ayohana kwakubhee bhakaimanya kubhee bhenebho nga amundu bhabhakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo. Ahelode bhakapala kwaajoanikia Ayohana na nambo handa bhaajohanikie bhatendita kuhechuka muno.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ahelodia bhakapata upenyo gwa kwaakoma Ayohana, wakati gwa lichobha likolongwa lya kubhelekwa kwabhe Ahelode. Ahelode bhakaatendelanga lichobha likolongwa akanaota bha libalacha lyakwe, manyemba na akaakolo bha ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Bahi, mwali jwa Ahelodia pabhakajingila penipala palitendeka lichobha likolongwa bhakahina, bhakaahachuanga muno Ahelode na akaageni bhabhe. Ahelode akaalobholela jono mwali, “Nnyope choachela chimmpala, na nenga mbakumpekea.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kabhele akaalapila, “Chohachela chimpakunyoopa, mbakumpekea, hata ikabhehe nga nusu ja ukolo gwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Penapo jono mwali bhakabhoka, bhakaakonya anyongo bhabhe, “Naajope chiniki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nabhena anyongo bhabhe akaajangula, “Nnyope mutwe gwa Ayohana Ambatichaji.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Amwali bhakaabhujila akolo chindema bhakaajopa, “Mbala umbekee ngocheni mutwe gwa Ayohana Ambatichaji mu chipalo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Akolo bhakakokoleka muno, nambo kwa ligongo lya kulapila kwabhe na ligongo lya bhenibhala akaageni bhabhakaalalika bhakalepela kwaakanikila. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Bahi, akolo bhakaakulumikia linyemba kuguleta mutwe gwa Ayohana. Alinyemba bhakajaula, bhakajaula mu chitabho na bhakaaheketa mutwe Ayohana, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />ngapena bhakaguleta mutwe mu chipalo, na kwaapekea amwali nabhena amwali bhakampekea anyongo bhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Bhanapunji bha Ayohana pabhakajipata ngani, bhakajaulanga bhakagutola mmele gwabhe Ayohana, bhakaguchika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakwaapekeanga chakulya bhandu elupu nhano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Amatayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Aluka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ayohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Bhenibhala akaandundame bhakabhujanga kubhakatumwanga, bhakakondanikanga nnongi ja Ayesu, bhakaabholela goha gabhatenditinge na kujigana. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Tujaulange jika jitu mpaka pantemela nkapomolelange kachoko.” Bhakalongela henela kwakubhehe kukibha na bhandu bhajingi muno bhabhatendita kuhikanga na kubhoka penepo hata Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe bhangakombolanga kulyee chakulya ligongo bhatendita kwatumikilanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Bahi, bhakakwelanga ntumbwi na bhakajaulanga pantemela.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Nambo bhandu bhajingi bhakaabhonanga bhabhikujaulanga, bhakaimanya kubhajaulanga. Henela bhajingi bhakabhokanga mu kila chilambo, bhajaulanga konokwe chindema yakubhee Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe pabhakibha bhatenda kujaulanga, bhakalongolelanga kuhika tangu kuhika angota Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ayesu pabhakahikanga nngulugulu mwa litanda, bhakabhona lilubhalo likolongwa lya bhandu, bhakaakolee kia, kwa ligongo bhakibhanga handa ngondolo bhabhangali na anchungaji. Henela bhakajemeka kwaajigananga hilebhe hijingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Kimuho pajikahika, bhanapunji bhakaajendela Ayesu, bhakannobholelanga, “Pambani nga pamanyai, na nangocheni lihobha litendakutipika. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mbaya mwapwilinganie bhandu bhajaulange mu hilambo na mu hijiji hiibhandikile, bhakachihemelele chakulya.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mwapengange mwaangota chakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Bhenaangota bhakankonya, “Bholi, tujabhule kuhemela mikate kwa mbiya dinali mia jibhele, na kwaapanganga chaakulya?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali mia jibhele gakibha malepo na mihei jinane ja wakati gonigola</char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Henela Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Mmilinge na mikate jilengwa? Nnyendange nkalolange.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Pabhakalolanga, bhakaalobholela, “Jibhii mikate nhano na homba hibhele.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Bahi, Ayesu bhakaakulumikianga bhanapunji bhabhe bhaalobholelange bhandu bhatamange malubhalo malubhalo pa manyahi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bhenaangota bhakatamanga bhangi bhakatamanga malubhalo ga bhandu makomi nhano na bhangi bhakatamanga malubhalo ga bhandu makomi komi. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaitola yeniyela mikate nhano na yeniyela homba hibhele, bhakalola kunani kumahunde, bhakaachukulu Annoongo, akaimetula mikate, bhakaapekeanga bhanapunji bhabhe bhaabhaganikie bhandu, na yeniyee homba hibhele bhakaabhaganikia bhoa. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bhandu bhoa bhakalyenganga, na bhakajukutanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ngapena bhanapunji bhabhe bhakalokotanga himbolopolo hiikahigalilana ya mikate na homba, bhakatweleanga hikapu komi na hibhele. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Bhandu bhabhakalyenganga akanalome jikajabhenji bhakibhanga handa elupu nhano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhajenda nnani ja machi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Amatayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Ayohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Popopo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe bhajingilange mu ntumbwi, bhaalongolele kujaula kuntundu mwa litanda mpaka ku Betisaida, popopo bhenabho bhakibha bhatendakwaatabhuka lilubhalo lya bhandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Pabhakajomola kwaatabhukanga bhandu, bhakajaula kulitombi kujopa. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Pajikibha kilo, ntumbwi gukibha pakati ja litanda, nabhena Ayesu bhakibha jikajabhe pa chilambo chijomo. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Bhakaabhonanga bhanapunji bhabhe bhabhikulaganga kwa kupota mbundi ngolongwa ya ntumbwi kwa machili, kwakubhee mboongo jitendita kwaahibhilanga. Kubhandikila na kuchee, Ayesu bhakaajendelanga bhanapunji bhabhi kujenda nnani ja machi, bhakapala kwapetanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Pabhakammonanga bhabhikujenda nnani ja machi, bhakaganikianga nga lihimwi, “Bhakapotanga nyenye,” <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />kwakubhee bhoa pabhakammonanga bhakajogopanga, kachoko Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga nabho, “Nkotokange, nkotokujogopanga nga nenga!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ngapena bhakakwela mu ntumbwi gwabhenji, na jenijela mboongo jikakotoka. Bhakakangachanga muno, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ligongo bhakibhanga tangu bhangaimanya maana ja nkongacho gwa mikate, na mitima jabhenji hikibha kulimba kuhobhalela.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamiyanga akaatamwa konikola ku Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Amatayo 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Bhakajombokanga litanda bhakahikanga chilambo cha ku Genesaleti, bhakagujemeanga ntumbwi gwabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Pabhakabhokanga mu ntumbwi bhandu bhakammanya Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Bahi, kwa chindema bhakatimbililanga mu chilambo chenichela choa, bhakaapetulanga akaatamwa mu hindanda yabhenji, bhakaapelekanga pohapala kubhakajoanga Ayesu bhabhile. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Kohakola Ayesu kubhakajaula, mu hijiji, kunnyini au poapala, bhandu bhakaapelekanga akaatamwa pa makonganilo ga bhandu. Bhandu bhabhakibhanga penapo bhakaajopa Ayesu hata bhakwaange mbiindo ja ngobho jabhe. Na kila bhabhakaakwaa bhakalama.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Majigano bhagapokililinge kubhoka kwa akanahota</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Amatayo 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Lichobha limo bhangi bha Mafalisayo na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa bhakibha bhabhokite ku Yelusalemu bhakalondanikanga nnongi ja Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Bhakabhonanga bhanapunji teno bha Ayesu bhatenda kulyee chakulya kwa mabhoko mahakwa, yaani panga kuha maha handa chiipalikwa na chiiyobhalilike na akanahota.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Maana Mafalisayo na Bhayahudi bhoa ngalyee chakulya pangali kuha mpaka pahindindili kubhokana na chiiyobholilike na akanahota bhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kabhele, ngalyee chilebhe choachela kubhoka kuchoko, pangali kuha kwa kuchijelejea oti. Kabhele kutekubhee na kuyobhelela kongi bhakupokile kubhoka lolo, handa henela namuna ja kuhijoa hikombe na hikalango na yoombo ya kutelekela.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Bahi, Mafalisayo na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Kwa niki bhanapunji bhinu bhalyee chakulya pangali kuha mabhoko handa chiiyobhalilike, ila hulyenganga chaakulya pangali kuha mabhoko gabhenji?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Ayesu akaajangulanga, “Akaandende mundu mwaangota! Alondohi Aisaya akalondola maha nnani jinunji pabhakajaandika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Annoongo alobhola, bhandu habha, kundopea kwa malobhe tu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">nambo mumitima yabhenji, ngahobhalela nenga.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kunyopa kwabhenji ngabha kwammbone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">maana ngani hiijiganwa nga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">malagilo ga bhandu tu ila ngabha gakubhoka kwa Annoongo.’”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Mwangota nnekanga amuli ya Annoongo na nkagulanga chiiyobhalilike na bhandu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Ayesu bhakapunda kulongela, “Mwaangota mmanyanga kulekanga malagilo ga Annoongo kwa kupenya kwinunji nkagulanga chiiyobhalilinge kwa akanahota. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Maana Amusa bhakalobhola, ‘Mwaatopeange atati bhinu na anyongo bhinu’ na ‘Bhoa bhala bhabhaatukana atati bhabhe na anyongo bhabhe akomekwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Nambo mwangota mwajigananga, ‘Handa amundu bhakweti chilebhe chakubhehe chakombola kwaajangatila atati bhabhe au anyongo bhabhe, penapo akalobhola kubhehe chilebhe chenecho nga Kolibani,’ yaani chibhekitwe ligongo lya Annoongo, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />kwa kutenda henela, ngapaalikwa kabhele kwaajangatila atati bhabhe au anyongo bhabhe. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Henela chinbheluanga lilobhe lya Annoongo kwa ligongo lya chinnyobhalilinge mwangota. Kabhele ntendanga hilebhe hijingi ya namuna jenejo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilebhe hiyaatenda amundu bhakoto kondekwa kwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Amatayo 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ayesu akalikema kabhele lyenilyela lilubhalo lya bhandu, akaalobholelanga, “Nyoonikiange mwabhoa, na mugamanye malobhe ga Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Chakwa chilebhe chichajiingila amundu yakubhehe chaatenda amundu bhakoto kondekwa na Annoongo. Nambo chichibhoka nkati nga chichaatenda amundu bhakoto kondekwa na Annoongo.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Amundu bhabhakweti na machikilo ga kujoanikia na bhajoanikie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabhokelo gangi ga Bibilia ya lolo gongo moomba gwaakwa</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ayesu pabhakalileka lilubhalo lya bhandu na kujiingila kaja, bhanapunji bhabhe bhakakonya maana ja kulongela kwa kuhiya. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Bholi, na mwaangota ngaelewanga? Bholi, ngahimanyanga kubhehe chilebhe chichaajingila amundu kubhoka panja, ngaatenda amundu bhakoto kondekwa na Annoongo? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ligongo amundu handa bhalile chilebhe ngaajingila muntima, ila mulutumbo, ngapena chibhoka panja ja mmele na kujaula kuliinda” Kwa kulongela henela, Ayesu bhakatenda yaakulya yoha hikondekwe nnongi ja Annoongo.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Bhakapunda kulongela, “Chichibhoka nkati ja amundu nga chichaatenda bhakoto kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kwa kubhee kubhoka nkati ja ntima gwa amundu, kubhoka kuganikia kubhou, na uloloi na bwihi na kukoma, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ngoongola na kulokolila hilebhe na ubhou na unami, na bwiu, na kuponja, na kulokolila ngoongola na mbwinya, na upumbavu. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mabhou haga goha gabhoka nkati ja amundu, na genago kwaatenda amundu bhakoto kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhobhalela kwa haikege bhamo ngabha Bhayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Amatayo 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Ayesu bhakobhoka ku Galilya bhakajaula kubhandikila chilambo cha ku Tilo. Konokwe bhakajiingila mu nyuumba jimo na bhangapala amundu bhoabhala bhaimanye, nambo bhangakombola kuchiiya. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Konokwe ku Tilo kukibha na haikege bhamo, yakubhee amwali bhabhe bhakibha na mahoka, pabhakajoa kubhee Ayesu bhabhi penipala, bhakajaula na kwaatindibhalila majugwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Bhakaajopa Ayesu bhammokee amwali bhabhe mahoka, nambo haikege bhenabho bhakibha ngabha Ayahudi, bhakibha bhabhelikwe ku Foinike, mu chilambo cha ku Silia. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Mwaleke bhana bhajukutange oti, ngayammbone kutola chaakulya cha bhana na kuhipekea himbwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Nambo bhena haikege akaajangula, “Nga kweli chinnongile Hangwana, hata himbwa hibhii pahi ja mecha kulyee upolo gwa bhana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Ligongo ntekujangula maha, nnyabhule kaja, lihoka lyabhokite amwali bhinu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Bahi, bhajaula kwaachakwe, bhakaakolela amwana bhagoolikwe pachindanda, na mahoka gakibha gabhookite.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamia bubu na bhankomela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakabhoka chilambo cha ku Tilo, bhakapetela ku Sidoni, bhakahika litanda lya ku Galilaya na kuhika mahali pa Dekapoli maana gakwe hilambo komi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Konokwe, bhandu bhakannetela Ayesu amundu bhamo bubu yakubhee kabhele bhakibha na chimamata, bhakaapembelela bhaajopele na bhaabhekele mabhoko ili kwaalamia. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ayesu bhakaabheka nnyeenje na lilubhalo lya bhandu, bhakaabhekela ngoonji mmachikilo, bhakaunila mata na kwakwaa lulimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ngapena bhakalola kunani kulihunde, bhakatulua mboomo kwakolela kiha, bhakaalobholela, “Epata,” maana gakwe, “Nnyoanikie.” <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Popopo machikilo gakwe gakajogoka na lulimi lwake lukalegeleka, bhakajemeka kulongela maha. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Ayesu bhakaakanikianga bhakotokunnobholelanga mundu joa jola nnani ja chikubho chenecho. Nambo chibhakapunda kwaakelebhuanga, ngapena bhakapundanga kujeneanga ngani yeneyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bhandu bhakakangachanga muno, bhakalobholanga, “Bhateendite goa maha, bhatekwaatenda bhankomela kujoanikia, na bubu kulongela!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu atendakwaapekeanga chaakulya bhandu handa elupu ncheche</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Amatayo 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Machobha genago, lilubhalo likolongwa lya bhandu likakondekana kabhele, na bhakibhangahopo na chaakulya. Bahi, Ayesu akaakemanga bhakanapunji bhabhe, akaalobholelanga, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Ndendakwaakolela kiha habha bhandu ligongo bhabhilinge na nenga kwa machobha gatatu, na bhabhilingehopo na chakulya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Handa naalekitinge bhajaulange kwaachabhenji kongo bhabhii na njala bhapakuhindukanga nndela, ligongo pakati jabhenji bhabhilinge bhandu bhabhabhokitinge kutali.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakaakonya, “Pambani palulemba chipakupatikana koo chaakulya cha kwaajukutianga bhandu habha bhoa?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Mmilinge na mikate jilengwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Bhakannyangula, “Tubhii na mikate saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Bahi, akaalobholelanga bhandu bhatamange pahi. Bhakaitola jenijela mikate saba, akachukulu Annoongo, akajimetula, bhakaapekeanga akanapunji bhabhe bhabhametulile bhandu, na bhenaangota bhakaametulila. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Kabhele pakibha na homba hichoko kachoko. Ayesu akaachukulu Annoongo, akaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe bhaabhaganakie bhandu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Bhandu bhakalyenganga, bhakajukutanga. Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajolanga upolo ya mikate na bhakatweleanga hikapo saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Bhandu bhabhakalyenganga bhakibhanga bhandu handa elupu nchenche. Ayesu bhakaatabhukanga bhandu bhajaulange kwaachabhenji, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />na popopo Ayesu bhakajingila mu ntumbwi pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe, bhakajaula chilambo cha ku Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo bhapalanga hilolelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Amatayo 16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mafalisayo bhakahikanga, bhakajemekanga kulongelanabho na Ayesu. Kwa kwaajiga, bhakannyopa bhatende hilolelo kulangia kubhee bhatumitwe na Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Ayesu bhakeuchuka muntima gwakwe, akalobhola, “Kwa niki chibhelei chenjeni chipala kulangiwa hilolelo? Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, chibhelei chenjeni chipakulangiwahopo chilolelo choachela.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ayesu bhakaalekanga Mafalisayo, bhakakwela kabhele mu ntumbwi pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe, na bhakajomboka kuntundu ja litanda.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilongo kwa Mafalisayo na Ahelode</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Amatayo 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakalibhalilanga kupetula mikate, bhakibhanga na nkate gumo mu ntumbwi. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Ayesu bh akaakelebhuanga, “Mmangange miho! Ntamange kutali na chilongo cha Mafalisayo na chilongo cha Ahelode.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajemekanga kongolelana akaachibhenenji, “Bhalongela henela kwa kubhehe twaangali mikate.” <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Ayesu akagamanya genego, bhakaalobholelananga, “Kwaniki ntendakutaukananga ligongo mwangali mikate? Bholi, tangu mwangaimanya, wala mwangaelewanga? Bholi, mitima jinunji tangu jitekulimba? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Bholi, mmilinge na miho nambo ngalolanga? Mmilinge na machikilo nambo ngajoanga? Bholi, ngakombokelanga, <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />penipala panakajimetula jeniijee mikate nhano na kwapekeanga bhandu elufu nhano, nkakondekana hikapu ilengwa ya upolo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Bhakanyaangula, “Komi na hibhele.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Na panakajimetula jenijee mikate saba na kwaapekeanga bhandu elupu ncheche, nkakondekana hikapu ilengwa ya upolo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Bhakanyaangula, “Hikapo saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Ngapena bhakaalobholelanga, “Bholi, tangu mwangaimanyanga?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamia mundu jwangalola konokwe ku Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe bhakahikanga ku Betisaida. Konokwe bhandu bhakannetela amundu bhangalola, bhakaapembelela bhaakwae ili bhaalamie. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Ayesu bhakaakamula bhenabho bhangalola lubhoko, bhakaapeleka panja ja chilambo. Akaahunila mata mmio gabhe, akaabhekela mabhoko, akaakonya, “Bholi, mkombola kulola chilebhe?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Bhenabo amundu bhangalola bhakalola, akalobhola, “Ndenda kwabhonanga bhandu handa mikongo jitenda kujenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaabhekela kabhele mabhoko mmiho, ngapena miho gabhe gakajogolekwa, bhakakombola kulola kabhele, bhakalola kila chilebhe maha. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Ayesu bhakaalagikia bhajaule kwaachabhe, bhakaalobholela, “Nkotokujingila mu chilambo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo bhatendakwaakonda Ayesu kubhehe nga Akilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Amatayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Aluka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Ngapena Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajaulanga mu hijiji ya ku Kaisalea Filipi. Pabhakibhanga nndela Ayesu bhakaakonyanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Bhandu bhalobholanga nenga nga ganiki?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bhakaajangula, “Bhangi bhalobholanga mwenga nga Ayohana Ambatichaji, bhangi bhalobholanga mwenga nga alondohi Aelia na bhangi bhalobholanga mwenga nga bhamo bha akaalondohi bhangi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Bahi Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Bholi na mwangota, nnobholanga nenga nga ganiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Na bhenga Apetulo bhakaajangula, “Mwenga nga Kilisito.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaakelebhuanga bhanapunji bhabhe bhakotokwalobholelanga amundu bhoabhala kubhee nenga nga Akilisito.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola nnani ja kulaga, kujomoka na kuyoka kwabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Amatayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Aluka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakajemeka kwajigananga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Kubhehe nenga mwana bha Amundu mbakupata hibhini hijingi na kukanikwa na akanahota, akaakolo bha akaakung'i, na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa na kubhehe mbakomekwa nambo lichobha lya tatu mbakuyoka.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga ngani jenejo pangali kuhiya, penapo, Apetulo bhakaatola Ayesu nnyenje, na kujemeka kwakalipila. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Nambo Ayesu bhakatendebhuka, bhakaalolekeanga bhanapunji bhabhe, bhakaakalipila Apetulo bhabhikulobhola, “Mmoke nnongi jangu Lichetani! Maganikilo ginu ngabha ga Annoongo nambo ga bhandu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakalikema lyenilyela lilubhalo likolongwa lya bhandu pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe, akaalobholelanga, “Handa amundu bhoabhala bhabhapala kungagula nenga, nga ipaalikwa bhachikane oti bhene, bhakondeke kulaga hata kujomoka ligongo lyangu nenga, bhangagule. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kwa kubhee amundu bhoabhala bhabhapala kuguokoa umomi gwabhe mwene, bhapakugahobhea, nambo amundu bhabhapakuguhobhea umomi gwabhe ligongo lyangu nenga na ligongo lya Ngani Jammbone, bhapakugahokoa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Bholi, mundu bhapakupata na gammbone niki handa bhachipatite chilambo choha na kuguhobhea umomi bwabhe? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Amundu bhapakubhoa chilebhe niki ili bhakombole kugubhujia umomi gwakwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Amundu bhoabhala bhabhanibhonela honi nenga na malobhe gangu mu chibhelei chenjeni cha ngoongola na chichilemwitinge, nenga Mwana bha Amundu, mbakwaakana amundu bhenabho, penipala pabhapakuhika mu nng'anyimo gwa Atati bhabhe pamo na akaapangana mahengo bha kunani kulihunde bha Hangwana.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Ayesu bhakaendelea kwaalobholelanga, “Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, bhabhilinge bhangi pani pani kubhehe ngawenganga tangu kugubhona ukolo gwa Annoongo gubhikuhika kwa machili.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhabhonekana mu nng'anyimo gwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Amatayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Aluka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Pagakajomoka machobha sita, Ayesu bhakaapetula Apetulo na Ayakobo na Ayohana bhakaapelekanga nnani ja litombi litandamao, gubhakibha jikajabhenji. Konokwe Ayesu bhakabhonekana mu nng'anyimo gwakwe nnongi jabhenji, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />na ngobho yabhe hikibha hiyuu kuu, namuna yakubhee amundu bhoabhala bhabhachapa pambani padunia bhakoombolahopo kuijelejea namuna jenajo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ngapena bhanapunji bhatatu bhakaabhonanga alondohi Amusa na alondohi Aelia, bhabhikulongela na Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Apetulo akaalobholela Ayesu, “Bhannyigana, nga yammbone twenga kubhee pambani. Bahi, mbaya tucheenge hilendo hitatu, chimo chinu mwenga, chimo cha Amusa na chimo cha Aelia.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Apetulo na bhakaajabhe bhakajogopanga muno hata bhangamanya cha kulongela.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Ngapena likabhokela lihunde likaawekelanga, na lilobhe lya Annoongo likajoanika kubhoka mu lyenilela lihunde hibhikulobhola, “Jonjo nga Mwana jwangu junaapala, munnyonikiange.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Popopo bhanapunji bhabhe bhakalolanga kongo na kongo, nambo bhangammona amundu bhangi bhoabhala pamo na bhenaangota, ila nga Ayesu jikajabhe.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Pabhatendita kutuluka kubhoka kulitombi, Ayesu bhakaakelebhuanga, “Bhakotokunnobholelanga amundu bhoabhala hikubho hibhaibhonitinge, mpaka nenga Amwana bha Amundu chimbakuyoka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bhakagakamula malagilo genago, nambo bhatendita konyananga bhenaangota akaachinabhene, “Kongo kuyoka maana gakwe niki?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Na bhenaangota bhakankonya Ayesu, “Kwa niki bhabhajigananga malagilo ga Amusa bhalobholanga kubhehe nga hipaalikwa bhaike oti Aelia bhabhitangu kuhika Akilisito?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Eloo, Aelia bhatendakuhika oti kubheka hilebhe yoa maha. Hata henela, kwa niki bahi hitekujaandikwa mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo kubhehe Amwana bha Amundu bhapakulaga muno na kwaabhelua? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Nambo ndendakunnobholelanga, Aelia aikite, bhenaangota bhakaatendela chibhakapalanga handa chiikajaandikwa nnani jabhe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aeliya tayali bhaikite, Ayesu bhakaalengania Ayohana Mbatichaji na Aeliya. Ayohana Mbatichaji bhakatenda lihengo yakubhee Bhayahudi bhatendita kuhobhalela kubhee Aeliya bhapakutenda lihengo lyenelyo likibha lya kwaahalakia ndela</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamia kakombo bhabhabhii na mahoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Amatayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Aluka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ayesu pamo na bhenibhala bhanapunji bhabhe bhatatu pabhakahikanga kwa bhanapunji bhangi, bhakaakolelanga bhatekutindilwanga na lilubhalo likolongwa lya bhandu na teno ja bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhakibha bhatendakulongela nabho. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Kachoko bhenibhala bhandu pabhakammona Ayesu, bhoa bhakakangachanga muno, bhakammutukila ili kwaachalimia. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Ayesu akaakonyanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Ntaukananga na bhenaangota nnani ja niki?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Amundu bhamo pakati ja lyalyee lilubhalo likolongwa lya bhandu bhakajaangula, “Bhannyigana, naaletite mwana jwangu kwaachinu, bhatekola lihoka lilyatenditendite kulepela na kulongela. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Kila mala lyene lihoka palyaajingila, kwaagwia pahi na kwaatenda lyabhoke lihuluhulu nkang'wa, bhabhikuyaga mino na kakamala mmele goha. Nakaajopanga bhanapunji bhinu bhammoe lyene lihoka nambo bhakalepelanga.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ngapenga Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Mwangota chibhelei changahobhalela! Mbakutama na mwangota mpaka lii? Mbakumpumilianga mpaka lii? Munnetange jono kakombo kwaachangu.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Bhaangota bhakanneta jonijola kakombo. Lyenileya lihoka palikaabhona Ayesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Kachoko bhakaalekela chitamwa cha chihinduhindu jonijola kakombo, bhakagwee pahi, bhakagalabhuka pahi kongo lihuluhulu libhii kwaapita nkang'wa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Ayesu bhakaakonya atati bhabhe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">“Mwana jwinu bhajeemike kulwala henela kubhokela lii?” Na atati bha jonijoo mwana bhakaajangula, “Habhitangu mwana. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Nambo mala hijingi lyene lihoka litendita kwaagwia pa moto au pa machi ili bhaakome. Nambo handa nkombwile kutenda chikubho chohachela choonde ntukolee kiha ntujangatile!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Handa nkombwile! Goha gakomboleka kwa bhoabhala bhabhahobhalela.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ngapena bhenibhala atati bhakaguta kwa lilobhe, “Ndendakuhobhalela, nambo nnyangatile ili ngombole kohobhalela.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ayesu pabhakabhona lilubhalo lya bhandu bhajingi litendakujonjokeka chindema nnongi jabhe, bhakaakalipila lyenilyee lihoka na bhakaalobholela, “Mwenga lihoka lilyatenda hojo kakombo kubhehe ngalongela na nkomela, ndendakunhukumula, mwaabhoke hojo kakombo na wala nkotokwaajingila kabhele!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ngapena lene lihoka likapalia lilobhe, akaagwia jono kakombo pahi, ngapena akaabhoka. Jonijola mwana akibha handa malilo, na bhangi bhakalobolanga kubhee, “Ajomwike!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaakamula lubhoko, bhakannyimua, nabhena bhakajema.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Bahi, Ayesu pabhakajiingila mu nyuumba, bhanapunji bhabhe bhanankonya bhabhjikajabhenji, “Bholi, kwa niki twenga twangakoombola kwaabhoa lenilyee lihoka?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Na bhena Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Lihoka lya jonjoni ngakombola kubhoka ila nga hipaalikwa kwa kujopa tu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola kabhele nnani ja kujomoka na kuyoka kwabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Amatayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Aluka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe bhakabhokanga penapo, bhakaendeleanga na ulendo kupetela chilambo cha ku Galilaya. Ayesu bhangapala bhandu bhaimanye pabhabhile, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ligongo bhatendita kwajigana bhanapunji bhabhe. Bhakaalobholelanga, “Nenga Amwana bha Amundu mbakugalukwa na kulekelwa mu mabhoko ga bhandu na bhenaangota bhapakungoma, nambo lichobha lya tatu mbakuyoka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Nambo bhanapunji bhabhe bhangaimanya maana ja chenichela chibhakalobholelwa, bhakajogopanga kwaakonya.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nga ganiki bhabhabhii akolo?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Amatayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Aluka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe pabhakahikanga ku Kapelenaumu, na pabhakibhanga pakaja, bhakaakonyanga, “Ntendita kutaukana chiniki nndela?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Nambo bhenaangota bhakatamanga jii, maana nndela bhatendita kutaukana nga ganiki bhabhabhii akolo pakati jabhenji.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Ayesu bhakatama pahi, bhakaakemanga bhenibhala bhanapunji komi na bhabhele, akaalobholelanga, “Mundu bhoabhala bhabhapala kujemeka hipaalikwa bhabhee bha mwicho kwa akaapangana mahengo bhoha.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ngapena akaatola mwana achokochoko, bhakannyemea pakati jabhenji, bhakaakumbatila, na kwaalobholelanga, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Bhabhampokela mwana handa hojo ligongo lya lihina lya Ayesu, bhambokile na nenga, na bhabhambokela nenga, bhambokelahopo nenga jika jangu, bali nga bhaapokela bhenibhala bhabhandumite.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amundu bhabhangatukana twenga bhabhii pamo na twenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Aluka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Ayohana akaalobholela Ayesu, “Bhannyigana, tumweni mundu jumo bhabhikubhoa lihoka kwa lihina linu, na twenga twakalenga kwaakelebhua ligongo nga jumo jwitu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Nambo Ayesu akalobhola, “Nkotokunkanikia, maana bhakwa amundu bhabhatenda yakangachika kwa lihina lyangu, ngapena kombola kulongela gangalimmbone nnani jangu. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga nkotokwahibhila amundu habha chibhatenda. Kwakubhee amundu bhaobhala bhangatukaana twenga, bhabhii pamo na twenga. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ndenda kunnobholelanga kweli mundu johajola jwaampekeanga chikombe cha machi ga kung'wee kwa lihina lyangu, ligongo mwangota nga bhandu bhabhe Kilisito, kweli ngapelela kupata hingwa yabhe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilebhe hiyaatenda amundu kutenda mabhou</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Amatayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Aluka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Handa mundu johajola bhaanyambukia jumo jwa akaachokochoko habha bhabhatendakunhobhalela kutendanga mabhou, hikabhehe mbaya mundu jonojwe kutabhwa liganga likolongwa lya kuyagila muntandala gwakwe na kwaatumbukia mubahali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Handa lubhoko lwinu lunyaambwie kutenda mabhou, muguhekete! Nga mbaya kujiingila mu umomi gwa machobha goha mmi na lubhoko lumo, ila nga kubhehe na mabhoko goha na kujiingila mu lihembo lyangapela konokwe nga kubhii na moto gwabhe ngahimika machobha goha. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Monomwe, mmi na unyee yangawee, na moto gwabhe ngahimika.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabhokelo galolo ga Bibilia gongo moomba gwakwa.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Na lukongono lwinu handa lunyaambwie kutenda mabhou, muguhekete! Mbaya kujiingila mu umomi gwa machobha goha pangali kubhehe na lukongono lumo, ila nga kubhehe na makongono goha na kujiingila mu lihembo lyangapela konokwe yakubhee moto gwabhe ngahimika. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Monomwe, mmi na unyee yangawee, na moto gwabhe ngahimika. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Na lio linu handa linyaambwie kutenda mabhou, mulibhoe! Mbaya kujiingila mu ukolo gwa Annoongo kongo mmi na lio limo tu, kuliko kubhehe na mio goha na kunnyea mu lihembo lyangapela. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Monomwe, unyee yabhe ngawee, na moto gwabhe ngahimika.”<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Annoongo bhapakwapetea kila amundu mu hibhini hiilandana na moto, handa henela bhandu chibhapakalanga mwinyo mu ndulu tangu kujitinia.”<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Mwinyo nga gwammbone, nambo handa kunong'a kwakwe kuhobhite, mpakutenda chiniki ili jinong'e kabhele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Na mwangota mmangange handa mwinyo gugukolonika, yani mmangange bhandu bha kuchikichana mwakaachinabhene.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhajigana nnani ja kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Amatayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Aluka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakabhoka ku Kapelenaumu na bhakajaula chilambo cha ku Yudea na kuntundu ja loochi lwa Yolodani. Nkutuli kwa bhandu bhajingi bhakaajendela kabhele, nabhena bhakaajigananga kabhele handa chiiyobhalilike.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bahi, Mafalisayo teno bhakaajendela Ayesu, na kwaakonya kwa kwaajiga, “Bholi, malagilo gitu gapaalikwa hangwana kwaaleka hanu bhabhe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Ayesu akaakonyanga, “Bholi, Amusa akaampekeanga malagilo niki?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bhenaangota bhakajangulanga, “Amusa bhakalagia kubhehe hangwana bhakombola kwaajandikila hanu bhabhe talaka na kwaaleka hanu bhabhe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Amusa bhakajandika malagilo gangani ligongo ngapokelanga majiganao. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Nambo tangu kualakilwa kwa dunia, ‘Annoongo bhakahalakia hangwana na mwikege.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Kwa ligongo lya henela mwanalome apakwaaleka atati bhabhe na anyongo bhabhe,’ na kulondanika na hanu bhabhe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />‘Na bhenaangota bhabhele bhapakubhee mmele gumo.’ Henela, bhenaangota ngabhee bhabhele kabhele ila nga mmele gumo. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Bahi, chibhalondanike Annoongo, amundu bhakotokulekania.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ayesu pabhakajingilanga kabhele nkati ja nyuumba, bhanapunji bhabhe bhakaakonya nnani ja ngani ja kulekana. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Na bhena bhakaajangulanga, “Hangwana bhoabhala bhabhaaleka hanu jwabhe na kuloombela bhangi, na bhena bhatenda ngoongola. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Na mwikege handa bhabhaaleka hangwana bhabhe na kulombelwa na hangwana bhangi, helahela bhena bhatenda ngoongola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaatendela gammbone bhana bhachoko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Amatayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Aluka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bhandu bhakaaletela Ayesu bhana bhachoko bhachoko ili bhakombole kwakwaanga, nambo bhanapunji bhabhe bhakaakalipilanga. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ila Ayesu pabhakabhona henela, bhakatumbala bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Mwalekange bhana bhachoko bhahikange kwaachangu, wala nkotokwahibhilanga, kwakubhee bhandu bhabhalinge handa bhana bhachoko habha nga bhabhapakujingilanga mu ukolo gwangu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, amundu bhoabhala bhabhakana kugupokela ukolo gwa Annoongo handa mwana nchoko chibhahobhalela ngajiingila mu ukolo gwa Annoongo.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ngapena bhakaanamatilanga bhena bhana, bhakaabhekelanga mabhoko gabhe nnani ja bhena bhana, bhakaalobholelanga gammbone.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amundu bhabhabhii na hilebhe hijingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Amatayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Aluka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ayesu pabhakajemeka kabhele ulendo gwabhe, amundu bhamo bhakaabhutukila, bhakaatindibhalila majugwa nnongi jabhe, bhakaakonya, “Bhannyigana bhammbone, ndende niki ili ngombole kugupata umomi gwa machobha goha?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Ayesu bhakaakonya, “Mboni mwenga ntendakungema nenga nga bhammbone? Bhakwa bhabhabhii bhammbone ila nga Annoongo jikajabhe. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Mugamanyi malagilo ga Annoongo, ‘Nkotokoma, nkoto kubhehe bha ngoongola, nkotokujibha, nkoto kubhoa uchahidi kwa unami, nkotokutemba, mwaatopee atati bhinu na anyongo bhinu.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Bhenabho bhakaajangula, “Bhannyigana, malagilo haga goha nagakamwile tangu nibhii kakombo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Ayesu bhakapia miho, bhakaapala, bhakaalobholela, “Ntekupongokewa na chilebhe chimo, nyaule na nkauche kila chilebhe chimminacho, mwaapekee akaahocho heyo mbiya, na mwenga mpakubhee na hilebhe hijingi kunani kulihunde, ngapena nhike nngagule.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Bhenibhala amundu pabhakajoa genago, bhakakokoleka muno, bhakajaula kongo bhabhii bhatumbiile ligongo hakibha hilebhe hijingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Ayesu bhakalola kongo na kongo, bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Hipakubhee lihengo muno kwa akaakola hilebhe hijingi kujingila mu ukolo gwa Annoongo!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakakangachanga muno kwa malobhe gakwe, Ayesu akaalobholelanga kabhele, “Akaachibhanangu, nga lihengo muno amundu kujiingila mu ukolo gwa Annoongo! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Nga kujojoka muno kwa chinyama chichikemwa ngamia kupeta pa lipobhole lya chindano, ila nga lihengo muno kwa akola hilebhe hijingi kujiingila mu ukolo gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakakangachanga muno bhakakonyananga, “Nga ganiki bahi, bhabhapakombola kuokoka?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Ayesu bhakaapia miho, bhakaalobholelanga, “Kwa amundu heche chilebhe ngakomboleka, nambo kwa Annoongo ngabha, ligongo goha kwa Annoongo gatendakomboleka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Apetulo bhakaalobholela, “Twenga tulekite hilebhe yoha na kunkagula mwenga!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Ayesu bhakalobhola, “Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, bhakwa amundu bhoabhala bhabhalekite nyuumba, annung'una bhebhe mwanalome, au anung'una bhabhe mwikege, au atati bhabhe, au anyongo bhabhe, au bhana au migonda ligongo lyangu nenga na ligongo lya Ngani Jammbone, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />bhapakupokela hilebhe hijingi muno wakati gongoni gwa nangocheni. Nyuumba nnung'una mwanalome, anung'una mwikege, anyongo, atati, bhana, migonda pamo na hibhini, ngapena umomi gwa machobha goha pa dunia guguika. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Nambo bhajingi bhabhakajemeka bhapakujomolekea na bhabhakojomolekea bhakujemeka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola pa tatu nnani ja kujomoka na kuyooka kwabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Amatayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Aluka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Na Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe bhakibhanga nndela kujaula chilambo cha ku Yelusalemu, na Ayesu akaalongolelanga. Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakatwelelwanga na bhoga, na bhandu bhabhakakagulanga bhakajogopanga. Ayesu akaatolanga kabhele nnyenje bhenibhala bhanapunji bhabhe komi na bhabhele, bhakajemeka kwaakongolela genigala gagapakumpata. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Bhakaalobholelanga, “Nnyonikiange! Tutendakujenda ku Yelusalemu, na konokwe nenga Amwana bha Amundu mbakugalukwa na akaakolongwa akaakolingwa bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigananga malagilo ga Amusa, bhenaangota bhapakunhukumula kujomoka na kungamua kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />bhenaangota bhapakundendela mbenje bhapakunhunila mata, bhapakumbota mihimbati na kungoma, nambo lichobha lya tatu mbakuyoka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayakobo na Ayohana bhaajopanga Ayesu ukolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Amatayo 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ngapena Ayakobo na Ayohana, bhana Azebedayo, bhakaajendela Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Bhannyigana, tupala ntuteendele chilebhe chitupakunyoopa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Ayesu bhakaakonyanga, “Mpalanga nintendelange chiniki?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bhakaajangula, “Ntulekelee kutama bhamo lubholo lwinu lwa kunnelo na bhangi lubhoko lwinu lwa kunchiji mu ukolo gwinu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Ngaimanya nnyopanga chiniki. Bholi, mpakombolanga kulaga handa chinnaganga nenga, au kujomoka handa chimbakujomoka nenga?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bhakaajangula, “Tutendakombola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Mpakombolanga kulaga handa chinnaga nenga na mpakujomokanga handa chimbakujomoka na mpakubatichwa handa chimbakubatichwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Nambo kutama upande gwangu gwa kunnelo au kunchiji ngabha lihengo lyangu kumpekeanga ila Annoongo bhapakwaapekeanga mpenyo bhenibhala bhabhaagulikwe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Bhenibhala bhanapunji bhangi komi pabhakajoanga genago, bhakajemekanga kwaatumbalilanga Ayakobo na Ayohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Henela, Ayesu bhakaakemanga bhanapunji bhabhe pamo, na kwaalobholelanga, “Mmanyanga kubhehe bhenibhala bhabhabhonekana nga akaakolongwa bha bhandu ngabha Bhayahudi bhatendakwalimbikianga bhandu bhabhenji kwa machili na akaakolongwa bhenabho bhakweti mamulaka nnani ja bhandu bhabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Nambo kwaachinunji hikotokubhehe henela, ila bhabhapala kubhehe akolongwa pakati jinunji, hipaalikwa bhabhee abhanda jwinunji, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />na bhoabhala bhabhapala kubhee akolongwa, hipaalikwa bhabhee abhanda bha bhoa. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kwakubhehe nenga Amwana bha Amundu nangaika kutumikilwa, ila nga kwaatumikilanga, na kubhoa umomi gwangu kubhehe ukomboi kwa bhandu bhajingi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaalamia bhangalola Abatimayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Amatayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Aluka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Bahi, bhakahikanga mu chilambo cha ku Yeliko, Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe pamo na nkutuli nkolongwa gwa bhandu pabhakibha bhatendakubhoka mu chenichela chilambo, bhakakongana na bhangalola bhamo, bhakemitwa Abatimayo, mwana jwa Atimayo, bhakibha bhatamite ngulugulu mwa ndela bhabhikujopa bhandu bhaajangatile hilebhe. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Pabhakajoa kubhehe nga Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti bhatendita kupeta, bhakajemeka kupalia lilobhe bhabhikulobhola, “Mwenga Ayesu, Mwana jwa Adaudi, ngoleekiha!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bhandu bhajingi akaakalipila ili akotoke, nambo bhena akapunda kukweha lilobhe, “Mwenga, Ayesu Mwana jwa Adaudi ngoleekiha!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Ayesu bhakajema na kulongela, “Munkemange bhahike.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Henela bhakaakemanga bhenibhala amundu bhangalola na kwaalobholela, “Nchipee ntima!” bhakaalobholela, “Nyimuke, bhatendakunkema.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Na bhena bhakajijea jenijela ngobho jabhe, bhakahomba nnani, na kwaajendelela Ayesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Ayesu akaakonya, “Mpala nintedelee chiniki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Bhena bhangalola bhakajaangula, “Bhannyigana, ndendakunnyopa ngombole kulola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Ayesu akaalobholela, “Nnyaule, kuhobhalela kwinu kutekunnamia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Popopo bhenibhala bhangalola bhakajemeka kulola, bhakaakagula Ayesu nndela.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhajiingila ku Yelusalemu kwa kuhangalala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Amatayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Aluka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ayohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Pabhakibha bhatendakubhandikila ku Yelusalemu, upande gwa chijiji cha ku Betifage na chijiji cha ku Betania, kubhandikila na litombi lya Mizeituni. Ayesu bhakaatumanga bhanapunji bhabhe bhabhele bhaalongolele, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />bhakaalobholelanga, “Nnyendange mu chijiji chichibhii nnongi jinunji. Pampakujiingilanga monomwe, mpakunkolela mwana liponda atabhitwe, yakubhehe bhangatamilwa na amundu bhoabhala panng'ongo gwabhe. Mung'opolange munnetange pambani. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Handa amundu bhoabhala bhankonyitinge, ‘Mboni ntendanga henela?’ Munnobholele, ‘Hangwana bhatendakumpala na bhapakwabhujia pambani muuda nyipinyipi.’”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bahi, bhakajaulanga, bhakaakolela mwana jwa liponda atabhitwe nngulugulu mwa ndela, kubhandikila na nlyango gwa nyuumba, pabhakibha bhatendakwaagopola, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />bhandu bhangi bhabhakibha bhabhandikile na penapo bhakaakonyanga, “Mwangota ntendanga niki penapo, kwa niki ntendakung'opolanga mwana jwa liponda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Bhenibhala bhanapunji bha Ayesu bhakajangulanga handa chibhakalobholelwanga na Ayesu, na bhakaalekeleanga bhajaulange. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bhakaapelekela Ayesu jono mwana jwa liponda, bhakatandikanga ngobho yabhenji nnani ja mwana jwa liponda jonojwe na Ayesu bhakatama nnani jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bhandu bhajingi bhakatandikanga ngobho yabhenji nndela, na bhangi bhakatandikanga nyaambi ya mikongo hibhakaheketanga mmigonda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bhandu bhabhakalongolelanga Ayesu na kwaakagula kuyetu, bhakakweanga malobhe gabhenji bhabhi kulobholanga, “Alumbalilwe Annoongo! Atendelwe gammbone bhenabho bhabhahika kwa lina lya Hangwana! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Annoongo agutendele gammbone ukolo guguhika gwa atati bhitu Adaudi. Alumbalilwe Annoongo bha kunani kulihunde!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Ayesu bhakajiingila ku Yelusalemu na kujaula jimo kwa jimo pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, bhakalolekea kila chilebhe maha. Nambo kwakubhehe ikabhehe kimuo, bhakabhuja ku Betania na bhanapunji bhabhe bhenibhala komi na bhabhele.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakugujopela gangali mmbone nkongo gwa ntini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Amatayo 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Malabhi jakwe pabhakibhanga bhatendakubhoka ku Betania kujaula ku Yelusalemu, Ayesu bhakibha na njala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Bahi, bhakabhona kwa kutali nkongo gwa ntini gubhii na mahamba gajingi. Akaujeendela ili bhalole handa gubhii na libibo lyohalela. Pabhakaguhikila, bhakakolela gubhii na mahamba jika, kwakubhehe gukibha ngabha muuda gwa kuhogola mabibo. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ayesu bhakagulobholela gonigola nkongo gwa ntini, “Kubhokela leleni na hata machobha goha gongo ntini ngaogola kabhele mabibo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Bhanapunji bhabhe bhakaajoa bhabhikulongela genago.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhajiingila pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Amatayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Aluka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ayohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Pabhahikanga ku Yelusalemu, Ayesu bhakajingila mu luhani lwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo na kujemeka kwaabhenganga panja bhandu bhabhatendita kuucha na kuhemela hilebhe monomwe. Bhakaipendekula meecha ya bhenibhala bhabhatundigananga mbiha, na hitengu ya bhenibhala bhabhauchitanga njebha, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />na Ayesu bhakaahibhilanga bhandu kupetula chilebhe choachela pa luhani lwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Na bhena Ayesu bhakaajigananga, “Bholi, jangajaandikwa, ‘Nyuumba jangu jipaakemwa nga nyuumba ja kujopela bhandu bhoa.’ Nambo mwangota mujitendite kubhehe nyuumba ja bhabhapoka hilebhe!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Akaakolongwa bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa pabhakajoanga genago, bhakajemekanga kulolea ndela ja kupala kunkoma Ayesu. Nambo bhakaajogopa kwa ligongo nkutuli gwa bhandu gukakangacha majigano gakwe.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Pajiikibha kimuo, Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabhe bhakabhokanga ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majigano gatupatite kubhoka kwa ntini gugujomite</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Amatayo 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Kundabhi tuputupu, pabhakibha bhatendakupeta, bhakagubhona gonigola nkongo gwa ntini gujomite gwoa, kubhokela kumikega mpaka nnani kumahamba. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Apetulo bhakagukombokela, bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Bhannyigana, nnole! Gonigola ntini guntekugulaani, gujomite!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Munhobhalelange Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, amundu handa bhalilobholile litombi hele, ‘Nnyikuke nkachijee mu bahali,’ pangali kubhehe na bhoga muntima gwabhe, ila handa bhahobhalile hikubho yoha kubhee gabhalongile gatendakuteendeka, bhapakuteendelwa chikubho chenecho. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ligongo lya henela ndendakunnobholelanga, goha pannyopanga na kuchali na kwaajopa Annoongo choachela nhobhalelange kubhehe nchipokilinge na chene chipakubhee chinunji. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Kila pannyopanga, munnekelele kila amundu bhabhannemwitinge, nabhena Atati bhinunji bha kunani kulihunde bhapakunnekelelanga mwangota kulemwa kwinunji.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Nambo, “Handa mwangota ngaalekeleanga bhandu kulemwa kwabhenji, hata Atati bhinunji bhabhabhii kunani kulihunde bhapakwalekeleangahopo mwangota kulemwa kwinunji.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabhokelo ga Bibilia ga lolo gongo moomba gwakwa</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhandu bhakonya nnani ja mamulaka ga Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Amatayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Aluka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ayesu na bhanapunji bhabbhe bhakahikanga ku Yelusalemu, pabhakibha bhatendakujenda paluhani lwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, akolongwa bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa pamo na akanahota bhakaajendelela Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bhakaakonyanga, “Genigala gantenda kila lichobha, bholi, ntenda kwa mamulaka niki? Ganiki bhabhampile mamulaka ga kutenda heye hikubho?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Mbakunkonyanga likonyekelo limo, handa mpakujangula, na nenga mbakunnobholelanga ndenda hikubho heye kwa mamulaka niki. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nnobholelange, mamulaka ga Ayohana ga kwaabatichanga bhandu gakabhoka kwa Annoongo au kwa bhandu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Bhakajemekanga kuchikonyanga bhakalobhola, “Handa tuloobhwile, ‘Gakabhoka kwa Annoongo,’ bhapakonya, ‘Mboni mwangahobhalelanga Ayohana?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Na handa tuloobhwile, ‘Gukabhoka kwa bhandu,’ bhandu bhapakuchimwanga.” Bhakaajogopanga bhandu kwakubhehe bhoa bhakahobhalelanga kubhehe Ayohana bhakibha alondoi bha Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Henela bhakaajangula Ayesu, “Twenga tuhimanyi hopo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Na bhena Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Na nenga ngaalobholelanga ndenda hikubho heye kwa mamulaka niki.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalandanikia Akilongoi bha Bhayahudi na akaalemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Amatayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Aluka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ayesu bhakajemeka kulongela nabho kwa kulandanakia, “Amundu bhamo bhakalema ng'onda gwa mzabibu, akachenga likukumba kulitindiila, na pakati jabhe akahemba lihembo mahali pa kuminyila zabibu, bhakachenga chilendo cha kulendelela. Ngapena bhakagujaika nng'onda gonogwe gwa mizabibu kwa akaalemi, na bhakajaula ulendo.” <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Machobha ga kuhuna pagakahika, akaatuma abhanda bhabhe bha bhenibhala akaalemi, ili kupetula chehemu ya mahuno ga ng'onda gwakwe kwa bhenabho akaalemi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Bhenibhala akaalemi bhenabho bhakaakamula, bhakaampota na bhakaabhenga pangali kwaapekea chilebhe. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Bhakaatuma kabhele abhanda bhangi, bhenabho kabhele bhakampota mmutwe na kwaatendela hikubho ya honi. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ngapena bhakaatuma akaabhanda bhangi bhajingi bhangi bhakaapotanga na bhangi bhakaakomanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Bhenabho bhakujomolekea, “Bhapakuntopea ligongo habhabha nga mwana jwangu.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Nambo bhenabho akaalemi pabhakaalola bhabhikuhika bhakalobholelana, “Jonjoni nga nnekelwa bha nng'onda gongoni bahi twaakome ili nng'onda gubhee gwitu! <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Henela bhakaakamula, bhakaakoma na kwaajea panja ja gonigola ng'onda gwa mzabibu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Ayesu bhakaakonya, “Akola ng'onda bhapakutenda chiniki? Apakuhika kwaakomanga bhenaangota bhekulema na kugujaika gono ng'onda gwa mizabibu kwa bhandu bhangi. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Bholi, mwangachomanga mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Liganga libhalikanitinge bhabhachenganga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">nangocheni litekubhehe liganga lyammbone kupeta maganga goa ga kuchengela!<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Hangwana Annoongo nga bhabhatendite chikubho chenje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">na lyene nga lyakangachika muno kwaachitu!’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Akaakolongwa bha akaakung'i, na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa na akanahota bhakaimanyanga yakubhehe kulandanikia kongoni kukibha ligongo lya bhenaangota. Henela bhakalenganga kwaakamula, nambo bhakagujogopanga nkutuli gwa bhandu bhajingi, ngapena, bhakanneka, bhakajaulanga.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulepa kodi kwa akolo bha ku Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Amatayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Aluka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ngapena, akaakolo bhenabho bhakaatuma Mafalisayo teno na chibhoga cha bhandu chichajaangatila Ahelode ili kujaula kwaalenga Ayesu mu genigala gabhalongela. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bhakaajendelela, bhakannobholela, “Bhannyigana, tuimanyi kubhehe mwenga nga amundu bhannongela kweli tu, na wala ngaajogopa amundu bhaobhala. Wala ngalola mamulaka ga amundu kwa kubhee ngapendelea, nambo mwenga mkajigana maha lilobhe lya Annoongo. Bholi, hipaalikwa kulepa kodi kwa akolo bha ku Loma, au ngabha? Tulepe au tukotokulepa?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Nambo Ayesu bhakagumanya ukaandendemundu gwabhenji, na akaakonyanga, “Bholi, kwaniki ntendakulenganga kupala kundangia? Nnetange oti jene mbiha nijilole.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bhakannetelanga jene mbiha, nabhena akaakonyanga, “Kumio na lihina hele nga lya ganaiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Bhakannyangulanga, “Nga lya akolo bha ku Loma.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ngapena Ayesu akaalobholelanga, “Mumpekeange akolo bha ku Loma chichibhi cha akolo bha ku Loma, na mumpekeange Annoongo chichibhii cha Annoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Na bhenaangota bhakakangachanga muno.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhajigana ngani ja kuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Amatayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Aluka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Ngapena Masadukayo, bhandu yakubhee bhabhalobholanga kwakwa kuyoka, bhakaajendelela Ayesu, kwaakonya, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Bhannyigana, Amusa bhakatulagakia henela, ‘Handa amundu bhawile na kuleka mwikege pangali kubhehe na mwana, bahi anung'una bhabhe hipaalikwa bhannombele bhena nhelwa, ili bhaabhelekee anung'una bhabhe yana.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Pakibha na akaanung'una saba, bhenibhala akolongwa bhabhenji bhakalombela na bhakajomoka pangali kuleka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Anung'una bha bhele akaalombela bhena nhelwa, na bhena kabhele bhakajomoka pangali kuleka mwana. Ikabhokela henela kwa anung'una bha tatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Akaanung'una bhoa saba bhakawenganga pangali kulekwa mwana. Na bhenibhla nhelwa bhakajomolekea kujomoka. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Henela bahi, lichobha lya kuyokanga bhandu, haikege bhenabho bhapakubhehe bha ganiki? Bhoha saba bhakibha bhatekunnombela.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Ayesu bhakajangulanga, “Mwangota nnemwitinge kwa kubhee ngagamanyanga Majaandiko ga Annoongo wala machili ga Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Bhabhawilinge pabhapakuyokanga ngalombelanga wala kulombelwa, nambo bhapakubhenganga handa akaapangana mahengo bha kunani kulihunde bha Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Kwa ngani ja kuyoka kwa bhabhawilinge, bholi, mwangachomanga mu chitabu cha Amusa namuna Annoongo chibhakalongela na Amusa kubhoka mu chenichela chitekete chichijaka moto, pabhakalobhola, Annoongo bhakaalobholela Amusa, ‘Nenga nga Annoongo bha Aibulahimu, na Annoongo bha Aisaka na Annoongo bha Ayakobo?’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Bahi, bhena ngabha Annoongo bhabhawilinge, ila nga Annoongo bha bhandu bhamomi. Kwa henela mwangota nnemwitinge muno.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli ngolongwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Amatayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Aluka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Bhamo bha bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhakaika, bhakajoa bhabhi kutaukananga kwabhenji. Pabhakabhona kubhehe Ayesu bhakaajangulanga maha, na bhena bhakaakonya, “Mu amuli yoha nga niki jijibhii ngolongwa?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Ayesu bhakajaangula, “Amuli jijibhii ngolongwa nga jenjeni, ‘Nnyonikiange mwangota bhandu bha ku Isilaeli! Hangwana Annoongo bhitu, nga Hangwana jika jabhe. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mwaapale Hangwana Annoongo bhinu kwa ntima gwinu gwoa, kwa mboomo jinu joa, na kwa malango ginu goa na kwa machili ginu goa.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Na jabhele nga jenjeni, ‘Mwapale ajinu handa chinchimpala mwabhene.’ Jakwa amuli jengi jijibhii ngolongwa kupunda yenjeni hibhele.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Penapo bhenibhala bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhakaalobholela Ayesu, “Bhannyigana nnyangwile maha! Kubhee Annoongo nga bhamo wala bhakwa Annoongo bhangi. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mwaapale Annoongo kwa ntima gwinu gwoa na kwa malango ginu goa na kwa machili ginu goa na kwaapala ajinu handa amundu chibhachipala bhene, nga yammbone kupunda kwabhokea Annoongo mbeeko na chadaka.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Ayesu pabhakabhona kubhehe bhajangwile kwa malango, bhakaalobholela, “Mwenga mmandikile kujingila mu ukolo gwa Annoongo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kubhokela penapo bhakwa amundu bhoabhala bhabhakalenga kabhele kwaakonya Ayesu chilebhe choa chela.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akilisito nga aganiki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Amatayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Aluka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ayesu pabhakibha bhatendakujigana kubhandikila pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, bhakakonya, “Mboni bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhalongelanga kubhehe Kilisito nga mwana jwa Akolo Adaudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Adaudi bhene bhakaatandaigwa kwa Mboomo ja Annoongo na bhabhi kulobhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Hangwana akaalobholela Hangwana bhangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Ntame upande gwangu gwa kunnelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">mpaka pambakwachindanga akaapwati bhinu.’”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Adaudi bhene bhaakema Akilisito nga Hangwana. Bahi, ikomboleka bholi Akilisto kubhee mwana jwa Adaudi?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Ayesu bhatekwaanyamukanga bhandu bhachibhekange kutali na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Amatayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Aluka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Nkutuli gwa bhandu bhajingi gukibha gutendakunnyonikia Ayesu kwa kuhangalala. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mu majigano gakwe, Ayesu akalongela, “Mmangange miho na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa, bhenaangota kupala kutyanga bhakibha bhawalitinge ngobho hitandamao na kuchalimiwa kwa kwaatopea mahali pamakonganilo ga bhandu, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />kabhele bhenaangota kupala kutama mu hitengu ya nnongi mu nyuumba ya konganilana Bhayahudi na kwaapekea napachi ja kutama mahali pakutopea wakati gwa lichobha likolongwa lya kulyee na kuhangalala. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bhenaangota bhatendakutolanga hilebhe ya akaahelwa kwa machili, kongo bhabhi kuchikopokeanga kujopa majopelo matandamao ili bhabhonekane bhammbone. Bhena bhandu bhapakupatanga hukumu ngolongwa muno.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwelwa jwaabhoite chadaka jammbone</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Aluka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakatama kubhandikila na chikapu cha kubhokea chadaka, pabhatenditakulola namuna bhandu bhajingi chibhatendita kubhoa mbiha na kulekela mu chikapu cha chadaka lya Nyuumba ja Annoongo. Akaakola hilebhe hijingi bhakabhoanga mbiha hijingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Penapo bhakaika haikege bhamo haocho, bhakabhoa senti hibhele ya hipande ya mbiya. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ayesu bhakaakemanga bhanapunji bhabhe, na kwaalobholelanga, “Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, haikege abhabha nhelwa bhabhoite hijingi kupeta bhangi bhoa. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Bhandu bhoa bhabhoitinge hilebhe yabhenji hiijonjokike, nambo nhelwa habhabha haocho bhabhoite hilebhe yoha yakwajangatila mu umomi gwabhe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola nnani ja kuhalibiwa kwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Amatayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Aluka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ayesu pabhakibha bhatendakubhoka pa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, anapunji bhabhe bhamo bhakaalobholela, “Bhannyigana, nnole maganga gangani makolongwa na nyumba yenjeni chiite kualala!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakajaangula, “Bholi, ntendakangacha heye nyuumba ngolongwa? Lyakwa hata liganga limo lilipakuhigalila nnani ja liganga lyengi, kila liganga lipakubolewa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga na kubhina</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Amatayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Aluka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ayesu pabhakibha bhatamite pa litombi lya Mizeituni, bhatendita kulolekagana miho na Nyuumba ja Annoongo, Apetulo na Ayakobo na Ayohana na Aandulea bhakaakonyanga pantemela, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Choonde ntulobholele heye hikubho hipakupiitila lii? Nga hilolelo niki hiipakutulangia kubhee hikubho heyo yoha hibhandikile kupiitila?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Ayesu bhakajemeka kwalobholelanga, “Mmangane miho amundu bhoabhala bhakotokuntembanga. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bhandu bhajingi bhapakuhikanga kupetela lihina lyangu na kulongela unami, ‘Nenga nga Akilisito!’ Bhenaangota bhapakwatembanga bhandu bhajingi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Pampakujoanga ngani ja ngondo na nong'omi nong'omi ya ngondo nkoto kujogopanga. Hikubho heyo hipalikwa kupitila, nambo kujomoka kwakwe nga tangu kuhika. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Bhandu bha chilambo chimo bhapakupotana na bhandu bha chilambo chengi, bhandu bha ukolo gongi gupakupotana na bhandu bha ukolo gongi, kupakubhehe na nnendemelo gwa undopi na njala jalikuluta. Hikubho heyo hipakupiitila nga handa kujemeka kwa hibhini ya kuchijogola mwana.”<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Nambo mwangota mmangange miho. Kwakubhee bhapakumpelekanga kumahakama na kumpotanga mihimbati mu Nyuumba ja konganilana Bhayahudi. Namwangota mpakupelekwanga nnongi ja bhatawala na akaakolo ligongo lyangu, ili mkombolange kwaatangachianga Ngani Jammbone. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ngani Jammbone hipaalikwa kutangachwa pachilambo poha. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Bhenaangota pabhapakunkamulanga na kumpelekanga pachebule, nkoto kuganikianga cha kulongela. Nnongelange choachela chimpakupekewa kwa muuda gonogwe. Kwakubhee ngabha mwangota bhampakulongelanga, ila nga Mboomo ja Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Penapo anung'una bhapakwabhoa anung'una bhabhe bhakomekwe. Atati bhapakwabhoa mwana jwabhe bhakomekwe, na bhana bhapakwapotanga bhapakwagaluka na kwaakomanga akaabhelei bhabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Bhandu bhoa bhapakunchimwanga ligongo ntendakungalanga nenga. Nambo jwaapakuchitimalika mpaka majomolekelo nga jwaapakuokoa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulaga muno kutendakuhika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Amatayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Aluka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Pampakubhonanga, ‘Chilebhe chakuhakala Annoongo chibhii mu Nyuumba jabhe.’ Bhandu bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge mu chilambo cha ku Yudea bhabhutukilange kumatombi na mundu jwaachoma bhaimanye. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Bhandu bhabhabhile panja ja nyuumba jabhena bhakoto kujiingila mu nyuumba kutola chilebhe. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Bhabhabhile kumigonda bhakotokubhujanga kaja kutola ngobho yabhenji. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Bhapakulaganga hakaikege bhabhabhilenge na hitumbo na hakaikege bhabhajongeanga mu machobha genago! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Munnyopange Annoongo muno hikubho heyo hikotokupiitila machobha ga malili. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kwakubhee mu machobha genago kupakubhee hibhini muno yakubhee gangabhokela kandahi Annoongo pabhakaalakia chilambo na ngapiitila kabhele. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Handa Hangwana ngapoongoa machobha genago bhakalamite hopo amundu. Ligongo lya bhabhaahagwile, Hangwana bhagapoongwie machobha genago.”<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Mu machobha genago, handa amundu bhaannobholilinge, ‘Nnole, Kilisito Akomboi bhaabhi pambani,’ au ‘Bhabhi penipala,’ nkotokunhobhalela. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kwakubhee bhapakutilanga akaalondohi bha umani na bhandu bhabhachikema, ‘Nenga nga Akilisito!’ Bhapakutendanga hilolelo na hilebhe yakangachika, ligongo lya kwatembanga bhabhaagulikwe na Annoongo handa hikombolike. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mmangange miho. Nenga ndekunnobholelanga kila chilebhe chichipakupiitila.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amwana bha Amundu bhatendakuhika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Amatayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Aluka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Mu machobha genago, kulaga anakujomwike, lyoobha lipakubhee na lubhendu na lwei ngang'anyima, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />na ndondwa hipakugwee, na hilebhe yengi ya kunani hipakupukunyika. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Bhandu bhapakummona nenga Amwana bha Amundu nibhikuhika mu mahunde kwa machili gajingi na kung'anyima. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Mbakwatumanga akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde bhabhakondange bhabhaaguligwe kubhoka pande yoha ya pachilambo, kubhokela kujemeka hoko mpaka kujemeka kwa chilambo hoko.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chituchijigana kubhoka kwa nkongo gwa ntini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Amatayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Aluka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Nchijigane heche chikubhoka kubhoka mu nkongo gwa ntini. Nyaambi yakwe pahipakujemeka kuhipuka mahamba, mmanyanga kubhee chiimalupya chibhandikile. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Hela hela na mwangota pampakubhonanga hikubho yeniyela hiingannobholelanga gapakuteendeka, muimanyange kubhee nenga Amwana bha Amundu ndebhandikila muno kuhika. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nhobhalelange ndendakunnobholelanga, chibhelei chenjeni ngabhuja kwa Annoongo pangali hikubho yeneyo kubhokela. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Kunani kulihunde na chilambo ngapela, nambo malobhe gangu ngapeta ng'o.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhakwa amundu bhabhamanya lichobha wala saa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Amatayo 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Nambo kwa ngani ja lichobha au lisaa lyenelyo bhakwa amundu bhabhaimanya lipakuhika lii, wala akaatumichi bha kunani kulihunde, wala nenga Amwana bha Annoongo, nambo Atati jikajabhe nga bhabhaimanya. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mmangange miho na ncheange, ligongo ngaimanya hipakubhee lii. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ipakubhehe handa amundu bhabhabhoka kaja kongo bhabhikwaalekelanga malagilo habhanda bhabhe, kila jumo kubhokana na lihengo lyabhe, na kwaakulumikia jwaalolekea nniyango kuchea. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Ncheange, kwakubhee ngaimanya akola nyuumba bhapakubhuja lii, komboleka ipakubhehe kimuo au kilo ja manane au tuputupu au kundabhi. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ncheange handa bhabhujite kwa kung'ang'anuanga bhakotokunkolelanga ng'olwikinge. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Lyenilyela lindendakunnobholelanga mwangota, hela hela ndenda kwaalobholelanga bhandu bhoa. Ncheange!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ndela ja kwaakoma Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Amatayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Aluka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ayohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Gakahigalila machobha gabhele tu tangu kuhika lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka na lichobha likolongwa lya mikate yangalekelwa chilongo. Akolongwa bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa bhakibha bhatendakulolea ndela ja kwaakamula Ayesu kwa chili na kwaakoma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Nambo bhakalobholanga, “Tukotokunkamula muuda gwa lichobha lya Pasaka, kwakubhe bhandu bhakombolanga kulekelanga ukomu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haikege bhaapakala mahuta Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Amatayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Ayohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ayesu pabhakibha konokwe ku Betania kaja kwa Asimoni, bhabhabhii na mambujupuju. Pabhatendita kulyee ndalilo, haikege bhamo bhabhahika na mahuta gaganungila muno muchupa na ga bei ngolongwa, ngapena akajogola chene chuupa na akaakuchulila Ayesu mahuta genago mmutwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bhandu teno bhabhakibhanga penapo bhakatumbalanga, na bhakalobholelananga, “Kwa niki bhatendakuhalibhiana mahuta ga bei ngolongwa? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Mahuta gangani komboleka gangeuchwa kwa bei ngolongwa muno, na mbiha kwaapekeanga akaahocho!” Bhakaakalipila muno bhena haikege.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Nambo Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Munnekange! Kwa niki ntendakunhabhua? Andendile chikubho chammbone. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Akaahocho bhabhilinge pamo namwangota machobha goha, na ntendakombolanga kwaajangatilanga helahela chimpalanga. Nambo nenga ngabhee pamo na mwangota machobha goha. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Hojo mwikege ateendite chibhakombwile, bhalongolile kugubheka maha mmele tangu kunjika. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, poapala padunia Ngani Jammbone jipakutangachwa, chikubho chenecho chibhachitendite bhena haikege chipakongolelwa kwa kwaakombokela bhenabho.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayuda bhatendakoonda kwaagaluka Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Amatayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Aluka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Ngapena Ayuda Aisikalioti, bhamo bha bhenibhala bhanapunji komi na bhabhele bha Hangwana Ayesu, akajaula kwa akolongwa bha akaakung'i ili kwaagaluka Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Akolongwa bha akaakung'i pabhakajoanga ngani yeneyo, bhakaangalalanga na bhakaahaidi kwaapekea mbiha. Penapo Ayuda akajemeka kulolea ndela ja kwaagaluka Ayesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kulyee chaakulya cha lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Amatayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Aluka 22:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ayohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Kujemeka kwa lichobha likolongwa lya mikate yangalekelwa chilongo, lichobha lya mwana ngondolo jwa lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka ja kwaachenja, bhanapunji bhabhe bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bholi, mpala tumpanganikie koji chakulya cha Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Ayesu akaatumanga bhanapunji bhabhe bhabhele akaalobholelanga, “Nnyaulange kunnyini, na konokwe mpakongana na analome bhamo bhabhapetwile chibhega cha machi. Munkagulange, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mpaka mu nyuumba jibhapakujiingila, nkaaobholele akola nyuumba, bhabhajigana atendakonya, ‘Chibhikoji chumbi changu cha akaageni chimbakulila lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka pamo na bhanapunji bhangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Na bhena apakwalangianga chumbi cha nnani, chichibhekitwe maha. Ntupanganikiange monomwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Bhanapunji bhenibhala bhakabhokanga na kujaula kunnyini, na bhenaangota bhakakolelanga kila chilebhe maha handa chibhakalobholelwanga na Ayesu, henela bhakapangananga chaakulya cha Pasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Pajiika kimuo, Ayesu pabhakaika pa nyuumba jenijela pamo na bhanapunji bhabhe komi na bhabhele. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Pabhakibha bhatenda kulyee, Ayesu bhakalongela, “Kweli ndendakunnobholelanga, bhamo pakati jinunji bhabhalyee pamo na nenga, bhapakung'aluka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Penapo bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajemekanga kuhechukanga, na kila bhamo bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bholi, nga nenga bhambakung'aluka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Ayesu bhakaajangulanga, “Nga bhamo pakati ja mwangota komi na bhabhele, bhabhatobhela nkate pamo na nenga mu bakuuli. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Kwakubhee nenga Amwana bha Amundu mbakujomoka handa chiijandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo nnani jangu, nambo, kulaga kupakubhe kwa amundu bhenibhala bhabhakung'aluka nenga Amwana na Amundu! Hikabhee mbaya kwa amundu bhenabho bhangabhelekwa!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chaakulya cha Hangwana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Amatayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Aluka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bhakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Pabhatenditakulyanganga, Ayesu bhakatola nkate, bhakachukulu, bhakagumetula na kwaapekeanga bhanapunji bhabhe, akalobhola, “Ntolange nnlyangange gongoni nga mmele gwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kabhele bhakatola chikombe cha divai, bhakachukulu Annoongo, bhakaapekeanga bhanapunji bhabhe, bhoa bhakaching'welanga chikombe chenecho. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Akaalobholelanga, “Jenjeni nga miyai jangu jijijitika ligongo lya bhandu bhajingi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ndendakunnobholelanga kweli, ngang'wee kabhele divai mpaka lichobha lyalela pambakung'wee kabhele divai jiyono mu ukolo gwa Annoongo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ngapena bhakajembenga nyeembo ja kwaalumbalila Annoongo. Pabhakajomolanga kujembanga bhakabhokanga kujalua ku litombi lya Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhalondola kubhee Apetulo bhapakunkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Amatayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Aluka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ayohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Pabhakibhanga nndela Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Mwangota mwabhoa mpakubhutukanga na mpakunekanga nenga jika jangu, handa chiijaandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo, Annoongo bhakalobola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Mbakwapota anchungaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 14:27">na ngondolo hipakupwilinganika.’”<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />“Nambo pambakuyoka, mbakunnongolelanga kujaula ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Ngapena Apetulo bhakaalobholela, “Handa bhangi bhoa bhapakunneka, nambo nenga nganneka!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Ayesu bhakaalobholela, “Ndendakunnobholela kweli, chenje kilo cha leleni, tangu likambaliko lyangajemba pa bhele, mpakungana pa tatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Nambo Apetulo akapunda kolongela, “Hata handa mbaalikwa kujomoka pamo na mwenga, nganneka ng'o.” Na bhenibhala bhanapunji bhoa bhakalobholanga hela hela.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwajopa Annoongo ku Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Amatayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Aluka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Bhakahikanga mahali pakemitwa Getisemane, Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga bhanapunji bhabhe, “Ntamange pambani nenga nyaula oti kwajopa Annoongo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Bhakaatolanga Apetulo na Ayakobo na Ayohana bhakajaulanabho kutali kachoko. Bhakajemeka kuhechuka muno na kulaga, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />bhakaalobholelanga, “Ndendakuhulala muno muntima gwangu hata kubhandikila na kujomoka. Ntamange pambani na ncheange.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Bhakajaula nnongi kachoko, bhakachigwia manguku, kongo bhabhikujopa, “Handa ikombolike ngotokugupetela muuda gongoni gwa hibhini.”<verse eid="MRK 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Bhakalongela, “Atati bhangu, kwaachinu hilebhe yoa hitendakomboleka. Mmokee chikombe chenjeni cha hibhini, nambo ikotokubhehe handa chimbala nenga, na hibhee handa chimpala mwenga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ngapena bhakabhuja kwa bhenibhala bhanapunji bhatatu, bhakaakolelanga bhagolwikinge. Na bhena Ayesu bhakaakonya Asimoni bhakemitwa Apetulo, “Asimoni, bholi, ng'olwike lugono? Bholi mwangakoombola kuchea hata kwa lichaa limo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Ngapena bhakaalobholelanga, “Ncheange na kwaajopa Annoongo ili nkotokulengekwa na kutenda mabhou. Mwangota mpalanga kuchitimalianga, nambo mwangota mimele yinunji yangali machili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ayesu bhakajaula kabhele kwajopa Annoongo bhabhikubhujila malobhe gala gala. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ngapena bhakabhuja kabhele kwa bhanapunji bhabhe, bhakaakolelanga bhagolwikinge kabhele, mio gabhenji gakibha na lugono muno. Na bhenaangota bhangalimanya lya kunnyangula.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Pabhakaabhujilanga pa tatu bhakaalobholelanga, “Tangu ng'olwikinge na kupomolela? Nangocheni bahi! Muuda guhikite! Nenga Amwana bha Amundu ngocheni mbakukamulikwa na kupelekwa kwa mabhoko ga bhandu akaabhou. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Henela nnyemange, tujendange. Nnolange, bhenibhala bhabhapakung'aluka bhabhandikile kuhika!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakamulikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Amatayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Aluka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Ayohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ayesu pabhakibha tangu bhatendakulongela, Ayuda bhamo pakati ja bhenibhala bhanapunji komi na bhabhele, bhakaika. Pamo na nkutuli gwa bhandu bhabhalinge na mapanga na himbonga. Bhenibhala bhandu bhakatumwanga na akolongwa bha akaakung'i, na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa na akanahota. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Bahi Ayuda bhenibhala bhabhakaagaluka, bhakaapekeanga hilolelo bhenibhala bhandu kubhee, “Bhenibhala bhambakwachalimia kwaanamatila nga bhenabho. Munkamulange na mumpetulange bhabhii pahi ja kwalolekea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ayuda pabhakaika, bhakaajendela Ayesu jimo kwa jimo na bhakaalobholela, “Bhannyigana!” Ngapena bhakaachalimia kwa kwanamatila. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Bahi bhenibhala bhandu bhakaakamula Ayesu na kwaabheka pahi ja kwaalolekea. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Bhamo bha bhenibhala bhabhakibha bhajemitinge penapo pamo na Ayesu bhakaguholomola upanga gwabhe, akaapota abhanda bha akolongwa bha akaakung'i, bhakaaheketa lichikilo. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Ngapena Ayesu bhakaalobholelanga, “Bholi, nhikitinge pambani na mapanga na himbonga kungamula, handa nenga nga hapokii? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Machobha goha nakibha na mwangota nibhii kujigana pa luhani lwa Nyuumba ja Annoongo, nambo mwangangamulanga. Nambo ngocheni nga hipaalikwa Majaandiko ga Annoongo gakweele.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Penapo bhanapunji bhabhe bhoha bhakanneka na bhakabhutukanga.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Pakibha na nkakombo bhamo bhabhakibha bhatendakunkagula Ayesu bhakibha bhawaalite shuka. Na bhenaangota bhakalenga kwaakamula. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Nambo bhenabho bhakaapokonyokanga, bhakaalekelanga shuka na bhakabhutuka pangali kuwala ngobho.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu nnongi ja Chebule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Amatayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Aluka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Ayohana 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bahi bhakampeleka Ayesu kwa akung'i akolongwa, na akaalongoi bha akaakung'i bhoa, akanahota na bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa bhakibhanga bhakonganike. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Apetulo bhakaakagula Ayesu kwa kutali, bhakajiingila nkati ja luhani lwa akung'i akolongwa. Akatama pamo na alendei bhabhikujota moto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Akaalongwa bha akaakung'i pamo na Chebule bhakalongelanga ngani ya umani kwa Ayesu ili bhakombolange kwaakoma, nambo malobhe gabhenji gangalandana.<verse eid="MRK 14:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bhandu bhajingi bhakalongelanga ngani ya umani kwa Ayesu, namno malobhe gabhenji gangalandana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Ngapena bhangi bhakajemanga bhakalongelanga malobhe ga unami kwa Ayesu bhabhikulobholanga, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Twakaajoa habha amundu bhabhikulongela, ‘Mbakuhalibiana Nyuumba ja Annoongo jenjeni lilyangachengwa na bhandu kwa mabhoko, na kwa machobha gatatu mbakuchenga jengi jangachengwa na bhandu.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Nambo hata henela, malobhe gabhenji ga umani gwangalandana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Bahi akung'i akolongwa bhakajema pakati ja bhandu bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bholi, ngajaangula chilebhe? Bholi, ngabhona kubhee habha bhandu bhoha bhalongelanga malobhe ga kunhukumula mwenga?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Nambo Ayesu bhakatama jii, bhangalongela hata lilobhe limo. Akung'i akolongwa akaakonya kabhele, “Bholi, mwenga nga Kilisito, Amwana bha Annoongo bhabhalumbalilwa?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Ayesu bhakajaangula, “Eloo, nga nenga, kabhele, mpakumwonanga nenga Amwana bha Amundu ndamite upande gwa kunnelo kwa bhenibhala Hangwana Annoongo akola machili, nibhikuika mu mahunde ga kunani kulihunde.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Penapo akung'i akolongwa bhakapapula ngobho jabhe kulangia lilaka, bhakalobhola, “Bholi, Tulolee machahidi kabhele bha niki! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ntekujohanga mwaachinabhene chibhatekwaaponja Annoongo. Mwangota mmonanga bholi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Chebule joha jikanhukumula kubhee bhapaalikwa kujomoka.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bahi pakati jabheni bhakajemakanga kwahunila mata, bhakantabha chitambaa kumio, bhakampotanga na kwaalobholela, “Nnondole nga ganiki bhabhampotite!” Hata akaalendei bhakantola, bhakampota mapalamanda.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apetulo bhaakana Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Amatayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Aluka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Ayohana 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Apetulo pabhakibha tangu bhabhii mu luhani, haikege bhamo antumichi bha akung'i akolongwa bhakahika. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Pabhakammona Apetulo bhabhikujota moto, bhakapia miho, bhakaalobholela, “Hela hela na mwenga mwakibha pamo na Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Nambo Apetulo bhakakana, “Ngammanya, na wala ngalimanya linnongela.” Ngapena Apetulo bhakabhoka bhakajaula panja ja luhani. Penapo likambaliko likajemba.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Bhenibhala antumichi haikege pabhakammona Apetulo mahali penipala, bhakajemeka kwaalobholelanga bhandu bhabhakajemanga penapo, “Amundu habha nga bhamo bhabhenji.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Nambo Apetulo bhakakana kabhele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Nnongi kachoko, bhandu bhabhakajemanga penapo bhakaalobholela Apetulo, “Nga kweli mwenga nga bhamo bhabhenji, kwakubhehe mwenga nga amundu bha ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Nambo Apetulo bhakajemeka kuchilaani na kuchilapila bhabhikulobhola, “Nenga ngammanya amundu bhenabho bhannongelanga ngani yabhe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Popopo likambaliko likajemba pa bhele, ngapena Apetulo bhakakombokela namuna chibhakalobholelwa na Ayesu, “Tangu likambaliko kujemba pa bhele, mpakungana pa tatu.” Apetulo bhakaengeleka ntima, bhakaguta muno.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhapelekwa nnongi ja Apilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Amatayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Aluka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Ayohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Kundabhi tuputupu, akolongwa bha akaakug'i pamo na akanahota, bhabhajigana malagilo ga Amusa yakubhee nga Chebule joa, bhakapalanga kwaapeleka Ayesu kwa Apilato kilongoi kubhoka ku Loma. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Apilato bhakaakonya Ayesu, “Bholi, mwenga nga Akolo bha Bhayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Ayesu bhakajaangula, “Eloo, handa mwenga chinnongila.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Akolongwa bha akaakung'i bhakaahukumula Ayesu kwa hilebhe hijingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Apilato bhakaakonya kabhele Ayesu, “Bholi, ngajaangula lilobhe? Nnole nga hikubho hilengwa hiitendakunhukumula?”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Nambo Ayesu bhangajaangula lilobhe, henela Apilato bhakakangacha muno.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakwahumula kwaakoma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Amatayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Aluka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Ayohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kila lichobha likolongwa lya Pasaka, Apilato handa chiikayobheleka Apilato bhatenditakwaajogolela jubhantabhite jumo jwaampalite. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Bahi pakibha na amundu bhamo bhabhakemwa Abalaba, bhakibha bhatabhitwe pamo na matimbanyundo bhangi ligongo lya kukoma na kugaluka. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Nkutuli gwa bhandu gukaajendela Apilato na kwaajopa ili bhaaatendelange handa chibhayobhalile. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Apilato bhakaakonyanga, “Bholi, mpalanga naalekelelee habha Akolo bha Bhayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Akalongela henela ligongo bhakaimanya kubhee akaakolongwa bha akaakung'i bhakankamua Ayesu kwaachakwe ligongo lya bwiu.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Nambo akolongwa bha akaakung'i bhakagukolokea nkutuli gwa bhandu bhannyope Apilato bhaajogolelee Abalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Apilato bhakaakonyanga kabhele, “Bholi, ngocheni mpalanga naatendele chiniki na habha amundu bhamunkemanga Akolo bha Bhayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bhandu bhoa bhakapalianga lilobhe kabhele, “Mwabhambe panchalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Nambo Apilato bhakaakonyanga, “Kwa niki! Bholi, bhalemwite niki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Nambo bhenaangota bhakapundanga kupalianga lilobhe, “Mwabhambe panchalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Apilato bhakapala kugukolonia gono nkutuli kwa bhandu, bahi, bhakaelekelea Abalaba kubhoka mu chitabho. Ngapena bhakalagakia Ayesu bhapotwe nkela gwa ndomondo, ngapena bhaabhambe panchalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manyemba bhatendakwatendela mbenje Ayesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27">Amatayo 27:27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Ayohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Manyemba bhakaatola Ayesu bhakajaula nabho ku nyuumba ja Apilato, nyumba jenejo jikakemitwa Plaitolia, monomwe bhakakondekana manyemba goa. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bhakaaweka Ayesu ngobho ja Chikolo, bhakatotanga hiingwa ya miibha, bhakaaweka Ayesu mmutwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngobho ja zambalau jikibha jitenda kuwalikwa na Akaakolo</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Bhakajemekanga kwachalimia, “Chalamu Akolo bha Bhayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bhakibha bhatendakumpota nhimbati mmutwe, bhakaahunila mata, bhakaatindibhalila majugwa na kwaakotimila. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ngapena pabhakajomolanga kwaatendela mbenje, bhakaahula ngobho jenijela ja Chikolo na kwaaweka ngobho yabhe. Ngapena bhakampia panja bhakaapeleka kwaabhamba panchalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kubhambwa panchalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Amatayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Aluka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ayohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Pabhakibhanga nndela, bhakakongana na amundu bhamo lina lyabhe Asimoni, amundu bha ku Kilene. Bhena bhakibha atati mundu bha Alekisanda na Alufo, penapo pabhatendita kubhoka kumigonda. Bahi, manyemba bhakaakulumikia bhagupetule nchalaba gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ngapena bhakampeleka Ayesu mpaka mahali pakemitwa ku Goligota, maama jakwe, “Lingambwa lya mutwe.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bhakampekea Ayesu divai jibhakajiangalana na ntela gukemitwa manemane, nambo bhena bhakakana kung'wee. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Bahi bhakaabhamba panchalaba, bhakabhagananga ngobho yabhenji kwa gudugudu ili bhaimanye aganiki bhapakupata chiniki. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Jikibha kundabhi handa ja chaa tatu pabhakaabhamba Ayesu panchalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ligongo lya kwahukumula likabhekwa nnani ja mutwe gwabhe na likajaandikwa malobhe gangani, “Akolo bha Bhayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ngapena bhakaabhamba Ayesu pamo na bhakupokanga bhabhele pamichalaba, bhamo bhakibha upande gwabhe gwa kunnelo na bhangi akibha upande gwabhe kwa kunchiji. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Na penapo Majaandiko ga Annoongo gakakwela, genigala gagakalobhola, “Bhakabhekwa pamo na akaakola mabhou.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko ga lolo ga Bibilia gongo moomba gwakwa.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Bhandu bhabhapetita kubhandikila na penapo bhakaatukana na kupukunya mutwe yabhenji na kulongela, “Aha! Mwenga mwakalobhola mpakubomolana Nyuumba ja Annoongo na kuchenga kwa machobha gatatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Nchiokoe ntuluke nangocheni panchalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Hela hela akaakolongwa bha akaakung'i na bhabhajigana Malagilo ga Amusa bhakaatendela mbenje Ayesu na kulongela, “Bhakahokoa bhangi, nambo kuchiokoa bhene ngakoombola! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Nneke twaalole Kilisito, Akolo bha Isilaeli! Nangocheni bhatuluke kubhoka panchalaba ili tulole na kuhobhalela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Hela hela na bhenibhala bhandu bhabhele bhabhakabhambwa pamo na Ayesu na bhenaangota bhakaatukana.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakujomoka panchalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Amatayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Aluka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ayohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Pajikahika saa sita muhi chilambo choa chikawekelwa na lubhendu kwa muda gwa masaa gatatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Pajikahika saa tisa Ayesu bhakaguta kwa lilobhe likolongwa, bhakalobhola, “Aeloi, Aeloi, lema sabakatani?” Maana gakwe, “Annoongo bhangu, Annoongo bhangu, mboni ntekunneka?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bhandu bhangi bhabhakibha bhajemitinge penipala pabhakajoanga henela, bhakalobholanga, “Nnyoanikiange! Bhatendakwakema alondoi Aelia.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Amundu bhamo bhakabhutuka, akatobhela siponji mu siki, akatabhalila nnani ja nnai, akampekea ang'wee akalobhola, “Bahi tulole handa alondoi Aelia bhapakuhika kwaatulua panchalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ayesu bhakaguta kwa hibhini, bhakajomoka.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Penapo lipanjia lilikibha mahali panng'anyimo mu Nyuumba ja Annoongo likapapunika hipande hibhele kubhoka nnani mpaka pahi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Akolo bhamo bhamanyemba bhabhakajema nnongi jabhe Ayesu pabhakabhona kubhehe Ayesu bhatekujomoka namuna jenejo, bhakalobhola, “Nga kweli habhabha bhakibha Amwana bha Annoongo!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Pakibha na akaahikege bhabhalolita kwa kutali, pakati jabhenji bhakibha Amalia kubhoka chilambo cha ku Magidala na Asalome na Amalia anyongo bha Ayakobo achoko na Ayose. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Hakaahikege habha bhabhakalongana na Ayesu konokwe ku Galilaya na kwaatumikila. Pakibha na hakaikege bhangi bhajingi bhabhakahikanga ku Yelusalemu pamo na bhena.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakuchikwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Amatayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Aluka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ayohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Pajikabhandikila kimuo, kwa kubhee likibha lichobha lya Kuchiandaa, lichobha limo kabula ja Lichobha lya Kupomolela, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />penapo bhakahika Ayosefu bha ku Alimataya, anyumbe bha Lichebule likolongwa, amundu bhabhakatopewa muno. Bhena kabhele bhatenditakulolea kuhika kwa ukolo gwa Annoongo. Bahi bhakaajendela Apilato pangali kujogopa bhakaajopa ampekee mmele gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Apilato bhakakangacha kujoa kubhehe Ayesu bhatekujomoka. Bahi bhakaakema akolo bha manyemba, akaakonya handa Ayesu bhajomwike kweli. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Apilato pabhakalobholelwa na bhena akolo bha manyemba kubhehe Ayesu ajomwike, akaalekelea Ayosefu bhagutole mmele gwabhe. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Ngapena Ayosefu akaemela chanda, akagutulua pahi gono mmele, bhakaguhiligila chanda. Akagubheka mu likabhuli libhakalibhacha pamwala. Ngapena akalimbikia liganga likolongwa nnongi ja nnyango gwa likabhuli. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Na angota Amalia kubhoka chilambo cha ku Magidala na anyongo bhabhe Ayose bhakapabhona penapo pabhakaagoneka Ayesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kuyoka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Amatayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Aluka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ayohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Lichobha lya kupomolela palikajomoka, Amalia bha ku Magidala, Amalia anyongo bhabhe Ayakobo na Asalome bhakahemelanga mahuta gakunungila bhakajaulanga kugupakala mmele gwa Ayesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Kundabhi tuputupu, lichobha lya jumapili, kachoko tu lihobha palikajemeka kupiita bhakajaulanga kulikabhuli. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Na bhenaangota pabhakibha nndela bhatendita konyananga, “Nga ganiki bhabhapakutubhokea lyalyee liganga kubhoka pannyango gwa likabhuli?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Pabhakibha bhabhandikile na kuhika bhakalolanga, bhakalibhonanga liganga lyela litekukuegelela kutali kubhoka penipala pannyango gwa likabuli. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Pabhakajingila mulikabuli, bhakammona nkakombo bhamo bhawaalite ngobho jihuhu, bhataamite upande gwa kunnelo gwa lyela likabhuli, na bhenaangota bhakakangachanga muno.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Nambo bhenibhala nkakombo bhakaalobholelanga, “Nkotokangachanga, ntendakunnolea Ayesu bha ku Nazaleti bhabhakaabhamba panchalaba. Bhayookite, bhakwa pambani. Nnolange mahali pabhakanng'oneka.” <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Nambo nnyaulange nkaalobholelange bhanapunji pangali kwaalibhalila Apetulo kubhehe, “Bhatendakunnongolelanga kujaula ku Galilaya. Konokwe mpakummonanga handa chibhakannobholelanga.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Henela Apetulo bhakabhokanga monimola mulikabhuli mu bhakaachika Ayesu bhabhikubhutukanga, kwaa kubhee bhenibhala haikege bhakalendemelanga kwa bhoga nkolongwa na kangacha. Bhangannobholelanga amundu bhoabhala chilebhe choachela, kwa ligongo bhakajogopanga muno.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kwabhokela Amalia bha ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Amatayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Ayohana 20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ayesu pabhakayoka kundabhi tuputupu lichobha lya Jumapili, bhakajemeka kwaabhokela Amalia bha ku Magidala, bhenibhala Ayesu bhabhakaabhoa mahoka saba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mabhokeo ga lolo ga Bibilia kujemeka moomba gwa 9-20 yaakwa</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Amalia bha ku Magidala bhakajaula, akaalobholelanga bhenibhala bhabhakibha pamo na Ayesu, penapo bhatendita kujembanga minyembo ya kumalilo na kuguta. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Nambo pabhakajoanga kubhehe Ayesu bhabhii bhamomi na kubhehe Amalia bha ku Magidala bhaabhonite, bhangahobhalelanga.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhaabhokela bhanapunji bhabhele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Aluka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Baada ja genago Ayesu bhakaabhokelanga bhanapunji bhabhele bhabhii na kumio kongi. Bhanapunji habho bhatendita kubhoka ku Yelusalemu kujaula kumigonda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Pabhakaamanya bhakabhujanga, na kwaalobholelanga akaajabhenji, hata henela bhangahobhalelanga.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatendakwaabhokela bhanapunji bhabhe komi na bhamo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Amatayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Aluka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ayohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Hikubho 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Baadae Ayesu bhakaabhokelanga bhanapunji komi na bhamo bhabhakibhanga pabhatendita kulyee chaakulya. Bhakaakalipilanga ligongo lya kulimba kwa mitima yabhenji na henela yakubhee bhakakananga kwaahobhalelanga bhenibhala bhabhakammona kubhee Ayesu bhayokite. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ngapena bhakaalobholelanga, “Nnyaulange pachilambo poha, nkatangachange Ngani Jammbone kwa bhandu bhoa. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Amundu bhoabhala bhabhahobhalela na kubatichwa bhapakuhokolewa, nambo amundu bhoabhala bhangahobhalela bhapakuhukumilikwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Na hilolelo heye hipakulongana na bhenibhala bhabhahobhalilinge, bhapakutumianga mamulaka gangu kubhoanga mahoka na bhapakulongelanga kwa chilongelo chiyono. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Handa bhakamwilinge lijoka na hata bhang'wilinge choachela chichibhii na uchongo, ngahulaanga. Bhapakwaabhekela akaatamwa mabhoko, na bhenaangota bhapakulamanga.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayesu bhatenda kupetulikwa kujaula kunani kulihunde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Aluka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Hikubho 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Bahi, Hangwana Ayesu pabhakajomola kulongela nabho, bhakapetulikwa kunani kulihunde, bhakatama upande gwa kunnelo gwa Annoongo. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ngapena bhanapunji bhabhe bhakajendanga kila mahali bhabhi kwaatangachianga bhandu Ngani Jammbone. Hangwana bhakatenda lihengo pamo na bhenaangota na kulichibiticha lilobhe lyabhe kwa hilolelo hiikalongana na jene Ngani Jammbone.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>